(3955344, 561248, 63267, '<td valign="top">This scene has a lot of distractors for me.  The sillhouettes are out of balance and become places for my eyes to roam.  The sky has a fair share of noise in it.  Overall the dark area in the lows right corner throws it all out of whack.  <br/> <br/>If this was shot at a different vantage point to get the colors of the sky without the sun overpowering everything I think you would like the results better.  5</td>', 'This scene has a lot of distractors for me.  The sillhouettes are out of balance and become places for my eyes to roam.  The sky has a fair share of noise in it.  Overall the dark area in the lows right corner throws it all out of whack.   If this was shot at a different vantage point to get the colors of the sky without the sun overpowering everything I think you would like the results better.  5', '2007-08-01 01:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955345, 562067, 61818, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest, it''s a very nice shot but if I never again see another challenge entry of someone wearing a head wrap it will be too soon.</td>', 'I''ll be honest, it''s a very nice shot but if I never again see another challenge entry of someone wearing a head wrap it will be too soon.', '2007-08-01 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
