(3955427, 563328, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  But beyond that there isn''t much to look at. I woul dhave to give you a 6.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  But beyond that there isn''t much to look at. I woul dhave to give you a 6.', '2007-08-01 01:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
