(3955439, 562218, 63267, '<td valign="top">Composition is a little bland on this for me.  Looks noisey as well.  Colors don''t seem to pop off the monitor the way flower pictures should.  5.</td>', 'Composition is a little bland on this for me.  Looks noisey as well.  Colors don''t seem to pop off the monitor the way flower pictures should.  5.', '2007-08-01 01:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
