(3955450, 558246, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall shot. I had to check my monitor, I''ll dare say that this photo has purple hue to it. Sky seems to suffer some more from it, probably a post-processing artifact. Still a very nice photo.</td>', 'Nice waterfall shot. I had to check my monitor, I''ll dare say that this photo has purple hue to it. Sky seems to suffer some more from it, probably a post-processing artifact. Still a very nice photo.', '2007-08-01 01:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955451, 564558, 63267, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see a buddha statue so I can see what everyone is devoted to.  I would presume it is buddha, and this is amybe Thailand, with the elephants?  A great idea, just missing the important point.  6</td>', 'I wish I could see a buddha statue so I can see what everyone is devoted to.  I would presume it is buddha, and this is amybe Thailand, with the elephants?  A great idea, just missing the important point.  6', '2007-08-01 01:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
