(3955457, 557114, 63267, '<td valign="top">I see some sensor dust above the woman''s head.  For a free study that shouldn''t be there.  Lighting here is harsh.  Maybe if you tone mapped this you could clean it all up some.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'I see some sensor dust above the woman''s head.  For a free study that shouldn''t be there.  Lighting here is harsh.  Maybe if you tone mapped this you could clean it all up some. 5', '2007-08-01 01:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
