(3955484, 561430, 29269, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well here. The photo also tells a story, very important feature often lacking in our challenges. What takes away from it is the red shirt behind him, that creates this bright halo around his head. Not sure that I like it this bright.</td>', 'The soft focus works well here. The photo also tells a story, very important feature often lacking in our challenges. What takes away from it is the red shirt behind him, that creates this bright halo around his head. Not sure that I like it this bright.', '2007-08-01 02:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955489, 553849, 63267, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is exceptional and I expect even in a challenge with over 600 votes to see this score very well and find itself in the top ten.  The detail in the wing is incredible.  Beautiful colors.  You really nailed this one!  10</td>', 'Wow, this is exceptional and I expect even in a challenge with over 600 votes to see this score very well and find itself in the top ten.  The detail in the wing is incredible.  Beautiful colors.  You really nailed this one!  10', '2007-08-01 02:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3955493, 550716, 29269, '<td valign="top">Perfect! Right place at the right time. A little too hot on the fingers, but I bet you did not get a chance to reshoot this one?</td>', 'Perfect! Right place at the right time. A little too hot on the fingers, but I bet you did not get a chance to reshoot this one?', '2007-08-01 02:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
