(3958398, 553566, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great image, 10!</td>', 'Great image, 10!', '2007-08-01 17:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958416, 564272, 64670, '<td valign="top">The location is wonderful, the person taking the photo on the right is really not good.  If you were not able to wait until they left I would have cropped him out - I realise you''d loose some of the building but it would be worth it - with him in it, it looks less of a challenge entry and more like a snapshot.</td>', 'The location is wonderful, the person taking the photo on the right is really not good.  If you were not able to wait until they left I would have cropped him out - I realise you''d loose some of the building but it would be worth it - with him in it, it looks less of a challenge entry and more like a snapshot.', '2007-08-01 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958418, 560625, 64670, '<td valign="top">What a magic moment captured.</td>', 'What a magic moment captured.', '2007-08-01 17:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958421, 557188, 64670, '<td valign="top">Perfection.</td>', 'Perfection.', '2007-08-01 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958423, 564221, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.', '2007-08-01 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958425, 563434, 64670, '<td valign="top">Absolutely MAGIC image!  Brings such ''Joy'' to the day - well done!  10!</td>', 'Absolutely MAGIC image!  Brings such ''Joy'' to the day - well done!  10!', '2007-08-01 17:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958482, 564631, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''m  not normally particularly bugged by non-level horizons, but I think it''s really hurting this image. Everything really feels like it''s falling over to the right. Lighting glass is a bitch, eh?</td>', 'I''m  not normally particularly bugged by non-level horizons, but I think it''s really hurting this image. Everything really feels like it''s falling over to the right. Lighting glass is a bitch, eh?', '2007-08-01 18:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958494, 558180, 46832, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait but because of the angle it kind of looks like a disembodied head.  6</td>', 'Nice portrait but because of the angle it kind of looks like a disembodied head.  6', '2007-08-01 18:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958521, 564402, 46832, '<td valign="top">I don''t have a clue what this is - but it does meet the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t have a clue what this is - but it does meet the challenge.', '2007-08-01 18:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958560, 561240, 15711, '<td valign="top">I get kind of bored with cemetery shots, but WOAH  this is haunting. The duotone is perfect with the ghostly fog creeping in and out of the headstones.  Nicely done. 7</td>', 'I get kind of bored with cemetery shots, but WOAH  this is haunting. The duotone is perfect with the ghostly fog creeping in and out of the headstones.  Nicely done. 7', '2007-08-01 18:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958564, 561371, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhwuh!!!   What a gorgeous painting-like portrait of this beautiful animal.   You did so good!</td>', 'Ohhhhhwuh!!!   What a gorgeous painting-like portrait of this beautiful animal.   You did so good!', '2007-08-01 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958568, 560074, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the high key sense of it.  I think the hand in the foreground is a large distractive force.  Here eyes, face shoulder and arms are well lit but the hands take away.  I''m wondering if you just cropped it more squarely.  I think it would work. She''s quite lovely.</td>', 'I love the high key sense of it.  I think the hand in the foreground is a large distractive force.  Here eyes, face shoulder and arms are well lit but the hands take away.  I''m wondering if you just cropped it more squarely.  I think it would work. She''s quite lovely.', '2007-08-01 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958573, 558957, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I like the setting and softness around the boat.</td>', 'Lovely.  I like the setting and softness around the boat.', '2007-08-01 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958583, 564093, 15711, '<td valign="top">Baby shots can be rather cliche but this is really different and artfully done.  I like the post editing. The tones are effortless.  What I like most is that the adult hands, presumably the father, is wearing cuffs - all dressed, whereas the newborn is in his birthday suit, naked to the world.  Nice juxtaposition.  If I could change anything, I''d have the baby''s feet visible as well. Nice job.</td>', 'Baby shots can be rather cliche but this is really different and artfully done.  I like the post editing. The tones are effortless.  What I like most is that the adult hands, presumably the father, is wearing cuffs - all dressed, whereas the newborn is in his birthday suit, naked to the world.  Nice juxtaposition.  If I could change anything, I''d have the baby''s feet visible as well. Nice job.', '2007-08-01 18:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958591, 561921, 15711, '<td valign="top">My goodness.  He just looms out of the blur.  Great work on the eyes.  He almost doesn''t look real. If it were mine, I''d crop real close to the top of his horns and right below his chin and make it more of a headshot, but that''s just my taste.  Good luck. ;~D</td>', 'My goodness.  He just looms out of the blur.  Great work on the eyes.  He almost doesn''t look real. If it were mine, I''d crop real close to the top of his horns and right below his chin and make it more of a headshot, but that''s just my taste.  Good luck. ;~D', '2007-08-01 18:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958644, 556432, 15711, '<td valign="top">I see we enjoy the same types of scenes and editing.  I really like this.  If there were just something in the foreground like a person, an animal... not complaining, but in a perfect world........</td>', 'I see we enjoy the same types of scenes and editing.  I really like this.  If there were just something in the foreground like a person, an animal... not complaining, but in a perfect world........', '2007-08-01 18:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958651, 558027, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - that''s powerful.  I hope it''s subtlety doesn''t go over most DPCers heads.</td>', 'WOW - that''s powerful.  I hope it''s subtlety doesn''t go over most DPCers heads.', '2007-08-01 18:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958656, 561303, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is like a diorama.  MAN - Wonderful work. The colours, composition. WOW</td>', 'This is like a diorama.  MAN - Wonderful work. The colours, composition. WOW', '2007-08-01 18:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958660, 563666, 60698, '<td valign="top">Very colorful! Nicely done!</td>', 'Very colorful! Nicely done!', '2007-08-01 18:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958662, 559444, 15711, '<td valign="top">With the androgeny of eyes, it immediately brings to mind the suppression of many women hiding behind burkahs, although I''m sure many choose to wear them and are not forced. This could easily be a boy in hiding as well. Excellent detail. You could almost crop it panoramic style and only show the skin and not the dark fabric, but then the social commentary would be lost.  I think though, for the title to fit perfectly, the eyes would be looking directly at the viewer.  With the focus being so well done and the DOF so nicely executed - 7</td>', 'With the androgeny of eyes, it immediately brings to mind the suppression of many women hiding behind burkahs, although I''m sure many choose to wear them and are not forced. This could easily be a boy in hiding as well. Excellent detail. You could almost crop it panoramic style and only show the skin and not the dark fabric, but then the social commentary would be lost.  I think though, for the title to fit perfectly, the eyes would be looking directly at the viewer.  With the focus being so well done and the DOF so nicely executed - 7', '2007-08-01 18:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958664, 562757, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - Jax, I forgot all about that.  This is postcard worthy. ;~D</td>', 'WOW - Jax, I forgot all about that.  This is postcard worthy. ;~D', '2007-08-01 18:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958671, 559813, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great social commentary.  I love the juxtaposition between the three. If it were mine - I''d crop it panoramic style and eliminate a bit of the buidling''s reflection up top.  NO big deal though. I might have dodged a touch on the guy on the right to bring out his eyes ever so much.</td>', 'Great social commentary.  I love the juxtaposition between the three. If it were mine - I''d crop it panoramic style and eliminate a bit of the buidling''s reflection up top.  NO big deal though. I might have dodged a touch on the guy on the right to bring out his eyes ever so much.', '2007-08-01 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958672, 564098, 80311, '<td valign="top">Incredile natural perspective, I feel drawn by this one!</td>', 'Incredile natural perspective, I feel drawn by this one!', '2007-08-01 18:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958676, 548126, 15711, '<td valign="top">MAN - that''s a scary thought.  Great idea though.  I think that it would work better without the frame and some of the ultra white cropped off of the top and bottom.  Maybe it''s just me - I''ve really gotten into panoramic crops these days.  Still, I like the title and the image - gutsy choice.</td>', 'MAN - that''s a scary thought.  Great idea though.  I think that it would work better without the frame and some of the ultra white cropped off of the top and bottom.  Maybe it''s just me - I''ve really gotten into panoramic crops these days.  Still, I like the title and the image - gutsy choice.', '2007-08-01 18:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958682, 554667, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I love that the silhouettes are really crisp and defined.</td>', 'Nice composition. I love that the silhouettes are really crisp and defined.', '2007-08-01 18:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958685, 561290, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific perspective. Like they are walking on clouds.  Great tonal range too.  This is very cool.</td>', 'Terrific perspective. Like they are walking on clouds.  Great tonal range too.  This is very cool.', '2007-08-01 18:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958706, 563969, 61961, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  There is artifice but it works.  High score from me.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  There is artifice but it works.  High score from me.', '2007-08-01 18:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
