(3958945, 561740, 61552, '<td valign="top">You''re going to have to tell me how you got such a clear shot of the moon!  Obviously enlarged, but my moon shots are crap in comparison.  Good job!  8</td>', 'You''re going to have to tell me how you got such a clear shot of the moon!  Obviously enlarged, but my moon shots are crap in comparison.  Good job!  8', '2007-08-01 20:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
