(3958954, 564427, 15407, '<td valign="top">Might have been better without the legs &amp; feet...</td>', 'Might have been better without the legs & feet...', '2007-08-01 20:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958957, 561290, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the lines in this - being able to see both the clouds, the building above, the pyramid AND at the same time the interior and the two people is just special</td>', 'love the lines in this - being able to see both the clouds, the building above, the pyramid AND at the same time the interior and the two people is just special', '2007-08-01 20:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958960, 564076, 15407, '<td valign="top">Nice Post Processing on this one!</td>', 'Nice Post Processing on this one!', '2007-08-01 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958963, 563652, 71499, '<td valign="top">I think this one would be better if there was more contrast or shadows. And perhaps if you got more picture of what looks like the chimney. I love the lines...<br/>I just that would help it be even better :) <br/>5</td>', 'I think this one would be better if there was more contrast or shadows. And perhaps if you got more picture of what looks like the chimney. I love the lines...I just that would help it be even better :) 5', '2007-08-01 20:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958965, 562786, 71499, '<td valign="top">I love this one. <br/>The shadows, the emotion, highlights, dodging and burning, it really tells a story. <br/>Great picture!!!</td>', 'I love this one. The shadows, the emotion, highlights, dodging and burning, it really tells a story. Great picture!!!', '2007-08-01 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958978, 564559, 63267, '<td valign="top">While Ia m sure that some people will love the lighting, others will not.  I personnaly like the lighting, but I don''t like the pose.  I don''t like how the eyse strain to meet the camera the way they do.  It causes her left eye to be eclipsed and that isn''t what I like to see.<br/> <br/>Still a nice phot that a little head twist and eye straightening could really help. <br/> <br/>6.</td>', 'While Ia m sure that some people will love the lighting, others will not.  I personnaly like the lighting, but I don''t like the pose.  I don''t like how the eyse strain to meet the camera the way they do.  It causes her left eye to be eclipsed and that isn''t what I like to see. Still a nice phot that a little head twist and eye straightening could really help.  6.', '2007-08-01 20:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958981, 564561, 63267, '<td valign="top">Nice photo Anthony.  Good DOF.  team mate comment, no vote!</td>', 'Nice photo Anthony.  Good DOF.  team mate comment, no vote!', '2007-08-01 20:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958983, 561383, 15407, '<td valign="top">Looks much Loon Lake in the Crystal Basin. Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Looks much Loon Lake in the Crystal Basin. Focus is a bit soft.', '2007-08-01 20:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958984, 562786, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very hot. Just a very minor nitpick would be to dull the sheen on the nose and shoulder a little.</td>', 'Very hot. Just a very minor nitpick would be to dull the sheen on the nose and shoulder a little.', '2007-08-01 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958991, 564438, 63267, '<td valign="top">She is pretty, and look at the size of those ears.  I do however wish she were a bit lighter and the background a bit darker.  6.</td>', 'She is pretty, and look at the size of those ears.  I do however wish she were a bit lighter and the background a bit darker.  6.', '2007-08-01 20:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958992, 564355, 63267, '<td valign="top">I dont'' see a lot that I like in this photo. It looks more like a snapshot to me than anything.  composition feels wierd with what looks like a crooked horizon and  man standing straight up.  the tree behind him is a distraction.  Overall, just not a great photo.  5.</td>', 'I dont'' see a lot that I like in this photo. It looks more like a snapshot to me than anything.  composition feels wierd with what looks like a crooked horizon and  man standing straight up.  the tree behind him is a distraction.  Overall, just not a great photo.  5.', '2007-08-01 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958995, 564572, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  Good clarity and sharpness.  7.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  Good clarity and sharpness.  7.', '2007-08-01 20:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958997, 564355, 15407, '<td valign="top">Leveling the horizon would have helped the composure.</td>', 'Leveling the horizon would have helped the composure.', '2007-08-01 20:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3958998, 564511, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Unfortunately, only one eye looks to be in focus.  A little more DOF could fix that.  6.</td>', 'Very cute.  Unfortunately, only one eye looks to be in focus.  A little more DOF could fix that.  6.', '2007-08-01 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959002, 564384, 63267, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  good comp and exposure.  Good title.  7.</td>', 'Nice colors.  good comp and exposure.  Good title.  7.', '2007-08-01 20:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959006, 564583, 63267, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks harsh with shadows and highlights.  Would have liked the ear to not be cropped.  6.</td>', 'Lighting looks harsh with shadows and highlights.  Would have liked the ear to not be cropped.  6.', '2007-08-01 20:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959012, 564604, 63267, '<td valign="top">My first thought was I like this.  The more I looked at it the more I asked myself why and realized that I don''t like it as much as I thought I did.  There just isn''t much to appreciate here beyond the nice sky and the mountains.  but those mountains are eclipsed by the ugly fence and shrub in the center.  Had that been to one side or the other I think this would have been much better.  6</td>', 'My first thought was I like this.  The more I looked at it the more I asked myself why and realized that I don''t like it as much as I thought I did.  There just isn''t much to appreciate here beyond the nice sky and the mountains.  but those mountains are eclipsed by the ugly fence and shrub in the center.  Had that been to one side or the other I think this would have been much better.  6', '2007-08-01 20:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959015, 564639, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the comp, the lighting and the DOF.  The title makes it seem as if the animal were really playing.  I like it. 8</td>', 'Very nice. I love the comp, the lighting and the DOF.  The title makes it seem as if the animal were really playing.  I like it. 8', '2007-08-01 20:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959017, 560744, 67152, '<td valign="top">Macros of moving bugs are hard!  Nice effort, but the colors seem over saturated, the center composition is not very interesting, the image suffers from not being very sharp</td>', 'Macros of moving bugs are hard!  Nice effort, but the colors seem over saturated, the center composition is not very interesting, the image suffers from not being very sharp', '2007-08-01 20:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959018, 564438, 15407, '<td valign="top">Lots of unuasual colors in the picture perhaps a little too much saturation for me</td>', 'Lots of unuasual colors in the picture perhaps a little too much saturation for me', '2007-08-01 21:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959022, 553566, 67152, '<td valign="top">gorgeous soft treatment to show the beauty of the clouds while maintaining enough detail in the hills</td>', 'gorgeous soft treatment to show the beauty of the clouds while maintaining enough detail in the hills', '2007-08-01 21:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959023, 564239, 15407, '<td valign="top">Taken from?</td>', 'Taken from?', '2007-08-01 21:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
