(3959611, 561495, 70000, '<td valign="top">YES!!!!!  I just saw this in your flckr album and was completely baffled as to why I hadn''t seen this in a challenge yet. Personally I like the one where she is in the water better, but still this is PHENOMINAL! as usual I love your lighting and I also really liked your back story on the myth associated with this place. The makeup is cool  but I think it looks better in the other picture where her face is a little darker. so yeah, definitely going to have to give you a 10 on this one.</td>', 'YES!!!!!  I just saw this in your flckr album and was completely baffled as to why I hadn''t seen this in a challenge yet. Personally I like the one where she is in the water better, but still this is PHENOMINAL! as usual I love your lighting and I also really liked your back story on the myth associated with this place. The makeup is cool  but I think it looks better in the other picture where her face is a little darker. so yeah, definitely going to have to give you a 10 on this one.', '2007-08-01 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959613, 562177, 69493, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this shot, I just don''t like the expression on her face.  Plus she needs to loose the sunglasses.  The eyes are what really make a portrait.</td>', 'Great lighting on this shot, I just don''t like the expression on her face.  Plus she needs to loose the sunglasses.  The eyes are what really make a portrait.', '2007-08-01 23:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
