(3959678, 554717, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice try on the well known ribbon shot (or at least I remember it). It is hard to live up to the expectations when shooting similar/same objects as previous winners. Some people compare it to the original, others mark it down for the lack of originality...<br/> <br/>I''ll just comment on it my second impression: too much tilt. Tilt is OK, it works well in this shot, but I think that I would have preferred a lesser angle to the ground. Good luck with this shot. 8.</td>', 'Nice try on the well known ribbon shot (or at least I remember it). It is hard to live up to the expectations when shooting similar/same objects as previous winners. Some people compare it to the original, others mark it down for the lack of originality... I''ll just comment on it my second impression: too much tilt. Tilt is OK, it works well in this shot, but I think that I would have preferred a lesser angle to the ground. Good luck with this shot. 8.', '2007-08-01 23:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
