(3959914, 562940, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The photo has the feel of a magazine article, something I would see in National Geographic about an island in the Pacific.  A good on location portrait.  Color, lighting and detail are all great.  Only think I would have liked to have seen different is cropping the right so the hut post aced as a natural fram on the right the way the tree does on the left. Still a great photo and worth every bit of the 9 I am giving it.</td>', 'I like this.  The photo has the feel of a magazine article, something I would see in National Geographic about an island in the Pacific.  A good on location portrait.  Color, lighting and detail are all great.  Only think I would have liked to have seen different is cropping the right so the hut post aced as a natural fram on the right the way the tree does on the left. Still a great photo and worth every bit of the 9 I am giving it.', '2007-08-02 00:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
