(3959935, 564406, 63267, '<td valign="top">I can''t say this one speask to me.  In a way I see the humor, but on a personal note, this image just doesn''t grab me.  What is for next month, the same kid with a bong pipe?  A gun?  <br/> <br/>Pciture wise it is decent.  Focus is on the finger, not the face and I am guessing that is by design.  If so then I think you captured it well as it is the basis for the title.  Lighting in the back is bad though with bright spots that are distractors.  Lighting on the face is good but I wish I could see the eyes more.  the shirt is of course a distraction as I have to read it, but with this kid I find it to be true.<br/> <br/>Hide the guns and the drugs, as his shirt says, he is getting worse......6</td>', 'I can''t say this one speask to me.  In a way I see the humor, but on a personal note, this image just doesn''t grab me.  What is for next month, the same kid with a bong pipe?  A gun?   Pciture wise it is decent.  Focus is on the finger, not the face and I am guessing that is by design.  If so then I think you captured it well as it is the basis for the title.  Lighting in the back is bad though with bright spots that are distractors.  Lighting on the face is good but I wish I could see the eyes more.  the shirt is of course a distraction as I have to read it, but with this kid I find it to be true. Hide the guns and the drugs, as his shirt says, he is getting worse......6', '2007-08-02 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959940, 562783, 63267, '<td valign="top">This picture does nothing for me.  My eyes are all over the place.  who is the guy on the phone talkig to, who is dragging the suitcase, what is the woman carrying in her hand, what is her husband looking at?<br/> <br/>Lighting is horrible.  What is the big shadow on the woman''s belly?  Image looks soft all over.  Not a very pleasing image.  4.</td>', 'This picture does nothing for me.  My eyes are all over the place.  who is the guy on the phone talkig to, who is dragging the suitcase, what is the woman carrying in her hand, what is her husband looking at? Lighting is horrible.  What is the big shadow on the woman''s belly?  Image looks soft all over.  Not a very pleasing image.  4.', '2007-08-02 00:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959946, 563513, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the image.  Shame you have to put the disclaimer.  Don''t like the vignette in white.  it isn''t needed and added nothing to your photo.  It did however detract from it and bring my vote to a 6.</td>', 'I like the image.  Shame you have to put the disclaimer.  Don''t like the vignette in white.  it isn''t needed and added nothing to your photo.  It did however detract from it and bring my vote to a 6.', '2007-08-02 00:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959947, 560044, 63267, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Simple composition, simple photo.  Good lighting, dramatic sky and a 7 for a vote.</td>', 'Very nice.  Simple composition, simple photo.  Good lighting, dramatic sky and a 7 for a vote.', '2007-08-02 00:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959949, 558180, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great protrait.  very pretty face inded.  Well captured with excellent lighting, nice sharpness on the eyse and lips, softness everywhere else.  Brilliant! 10</td>', 'Great protrait.  very pretty face inded.  Well captured with excellent lighting, nice sharpness on the eyse and lips, softness everywhere else.  Brilliant! 10', '2007-08-02 00:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959950, 554912, 63267, '<td valign="top">Great photo, except for the lighting.  The shadow acrosss the face ruins it for me. Other than that spectacular and worth a 7.</td>', 'Great photo, except for the lighting.  The shadow acrosss the face ruins it for me. Other than that spectacular and worth a 7.', '2007-08-02 00:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959952, 564623, 63267, '<td valign="top">That tree branch is unfortunate as I am staring at that and not the falls.  6.</td>', 'That tree branch is unfortunate as I am staring at that and not the falls.  6.', '2007-08-02 00:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959953, 551433, 63267, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image.  good comp and lightin, details are there, not blown out or hidden in shadows.  Well done! 9.</td>', 'Nice clean image.  good comp and lightin, details are there, not blown out or hidden in shadows.  Well done! 9.', '2007-08-02 00:47:25.000000', NULL, 1);
