(3959976, 562251, 15204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail and color on the dragonfly.  I like the bokeh in the background very much.  Don''t hate me for saying I wish the composition was more interesting.  Maybe putting the dragonfly more in the corner and making use of the interesting diagonal lines (stick, wing, tail) to define the space and lead the eye better. 7 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful detail and color on the dragonfly.  I like the bokeh in the background very much.  Don''t hate me for saying I wish the composition was more interesting.  Maybe putting the dragonfly more in the corner and making use of the interesting diagonal lines (stick, wing, tail) to define the space and lead the eye better. 7 from me.', '2007-08-02 00:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3959987, 563652, 62727, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place!  I love the sepia tone you used here.  It works very well with the subject. 8</td>', 'What a beautiful place!  I love the sepia tone you used here.  It works very well with the subject. 8', '2007-08-02 00:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
