(3960037, 562364, 63267, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your title here fits. None of the flamingos are looking at the other''s butt.  The only butt clearly visible is entirely out of focus.  In that sense, your humor didn''t strike a cord with this picture.<br/> <br/>Photographically speaking this is a nice photo in color.  If you wanted me to focus on the butt, then crop the bird on the left.  If you want me to focus on the bird on the left, then crop the other two birds.  the bird being cropped on the right is completely a distraction to me.  5.</td>', 'I don''t think your title here fits. None of the flamingos are looking at the other''s butt.  The only butt clearly visible is entirely out of focus.  In that sense, your humor didn''t strike a cord with this picture. Photographically speaking this is a nice photo in color.  If you wanted me to focus on the butt, then crop the bird on the left.  If you want me to focus on the bird on the left, then crop the other two birds.  the bird being cropped on the right is completely a distraction to me.  5.', '2007-08-02 01:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
