(3960376, 563969, 53316, '<td valign="top">You simply <b>must</b> already know this picture is stunning.<br/> <br/>Her face is very slender!!  It looks a little strange, but then again it looks like there is some beauty there that is not of this earth.  Angelic, maybe.  I wonder... would this score at the top of the list in a portrait challenge?  The composition is very different, so maybe not?  But I love the composition as it really helps this shot stand out.  It isn''t just another portrait.. it is a glimpse into two worlds.  The left and right halves of the photo are so different from one another.  They clash a lot... bright colors versus faded, muddy color.  Then there is a profile view versus the straight on that are different... and finally the lipstick color clashes with the scarf colors, but they really do seem to enhance each other at the same time.<br/> <br/>So basically I guess my point is that this photo is a wonderful study in dualism and contradiction.  <b>I LOVE IT.</b></td>', 'You simply must already know this picture is stunning. Her face is very slender!!  It looks a little strange, but then again it looks like there is some beauty there that is not of this earth.  Angelic, maybe.  I wonder... would this score at the top of the list in a portrait challenge?  The composition is very different, so maybe not?  But I love the composition as it really helps this shot stand out.  It isn''t just another portrait.. it is a glimpse into two worlds.  The left and right halves of the photo are so different from one another.  They clash a lot... bright colors versus faded, muddy color.  Then there is a profile view versus the straight on that are different... and finally the lipstick color clashes with the scarf colors, but they really do seem to enhance each other at the same time. So basically I guess my point is that this photo is a wonderful study in dualism and contradiction.  I LOVE IT.', '2007-08-02 03:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
