(3960589, 553849, 68546, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro, the wasps back looks like it''s had some processing done on it though, did you use neat image? Overall the composition is good but it seems over processed and a little harsh.</td>', 'This is a nice macro, the wasps back looks like it''s had some processing done on it though, did you use neat image? Overall the composition is good but it seems over processed and a little harsh.', '2007-08-02 05:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
