(3961711, 564531, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun photo overall.  Nice capture of the action.  Something funny about the bg blur on this in the lower left throwing this off when I view it (can''t take my attention away from it).  The dirt around the horses forelegs is relatively sharp with a gradual focus fade to the bg fence.  On the left it''s obvious that a selection was made in that same plane of the image and blurred.  Exposure on the cowboy''s hat and upper body is blown out a bit.  Appears to be some extreme shooting conditions.  :)  Still...a cool photo nonetheless.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a fun photo overall.  Nice capture of the action.  Something funny about the bg blur on this in the lower left throwing this off when I view it (can''t take my attention away from it).  The dirt around the horses forelegs is relatively sharp with a gradual focus fade to the bg fence.  On the left it''s obvious that a selection was made in that same plane of the image and blurred.  Exposure on the cowboy''s hat and upper body is blown out a bit.  Appears to be some extreme shooting conditions.  :)  Still...a cool photo nonetheless. All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 13:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961751, 563321, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. For me, it would have more impact if the person on the left was cropped out completely - just leaving the chairs on either end and the three people. That and little bit lighter sky and I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'I like the concept. For me, it would have more impact if the person on the left was cropped out completely - just leaving the chairs on either end and the three people. That and little bit lighter sky and I would have scored it higher.', '2007-08-02 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961761, 564534, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image!  Well seen and captured.  I like everything about it (especially the contrasting sky with the yellow) except for the roadway showing in the bottom left.  It would be perfect (9 or 10) without it.  As is it''s a 7 from me.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful image!  Well seen and captured.  I like everything about it (especially the contrasting sky with the yellow) except for the roadway showing in the bottom left.  It would be perfect (9 or 10) without it.  As is it''s a 7 from me.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
