(3961911, 563969, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Oddly enough, its the reflection that appeals to me most in your image. The woman herself is so very bright, yet it''s the soft reflection that appeals to me. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice image. Oddly enough, its the reflection that appeals to me most in your image. The woman herself is so very bright, yet it''s the soft reflection that appeals to me. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 13:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961917, 564590, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the de-saturation of your image, but that''s just me. The trees, wires and poles seem to have an odd gray outline around them.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the de-saturation of your image, but that''s just me. The trees, wires and poles seem to have an odd gray outline around them.', '2007-08-02 13:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961918, 548860, 41675, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit overly sharpened, but I do like the bright blue against the night sky. Nice fireworks shot.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit overly sharpened, but I do like the bright blue against the night sky. Nice fireworks shot.', '2007-08-02 14:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961921, 559545, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your image comes across as very yellow and the lighting seems harsh, but I do like your concept.</td>', 'Your image comes across as very yellow and the lighting seems harsh, but I do like your concept.', '2007-08-02 14:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961922, 561225, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and color tones. A sweet image. One to be framed and displayed.</td>', 'I like the soft focus and color tones. A sweet image. One to be framed and displayed.', '2007-08-02 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961982, 563536, 49109, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, well composed, like especially the copper tones and the POV</td>', 'beautiful shot, well composed, like especially the copper tones and the POV', '2007-08-02 14:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3961999, 557114, 46832, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  There is a spot of dust on your sensor.  You could have cloned that out.</td>', 'Ouch.  There is a spot of dust on your sensor.  You could have cloned that out.', '2007-08-02 14:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962022, 562980, 49109, '<td valign="top">that''s too funny!</td>', 'that''s too funny!', '2007-08-02 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962029, 564387, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the way you''ve found an audience.  :)  Very nice capture of a moody scene.  The contrasting sky and colors is quite vivid.  The greens may be pushed just a tad too much (looks unnatural, although it very well may BE that green).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the way you''ve found an audience.  :)  Very nice capture of a moody scene.  The contrasting sky and colors is quite vivid.  The greens may be pushed just a tad too much (looks unnatural, although it very well may BE that green).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 14:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962032, 558347, 30049, '<td valign="top">Just a slight amount of blur in this, which is a shame because there is alot of detail there that could really jump out.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Just a slight amount of blur in this, which is a shame because there is alot of detail there that could really jump out.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 14:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962040, 564211, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  We have two Jack Russells...a handful for sure.  I like the detail in the eyes on this.  One thing not quite right to me is it appears that when you burned around the nose the white took on a grey cast.  A slight blue tint that could be backed out with a color balance adjustment also. JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He-he.  We have two Jack Russells...a handful for sure.  I like the detail in the eyes on this.  One thing not quite right to me is it appears that when you burned around the nose the white took on a grey cast.  A slight blue tint that could be backed out with a color balance adjustment also. JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 14:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962046, 555193, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Could use more contrast, and truer wht/black points (via curves, levels, or histogram adjustment).  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute.  Could use more contrast, and truer wht/black points (via curves, levels, or histogram adjustment).  Good luck.', '2007-08-02 14:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962063, 564015, 78229, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous! 8</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous! 8', '2007-08-02 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962073, 564056, 4517, '<td valign="top">Terrific light and just the right amount of processing. Top marks 10.</td>', 'Terrific light and just the right amount of processing. Top marks 10.', '2007-08-02 14:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962074, 552399, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great colours.</td>', 'Great colours.', '2007-08-02 14:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962092, 554833, 4517, '<td valign="top">To much hdr but good subject.</td>', 'To much hdr but good subject.', '2007-08-02 14:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962097, 563576, 3459, '<td valign="top">I love the noise, and the texture, 9!</td>', 'I love the noise, and the texture, 9!', '2007-08-02 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962193, 550310, 81852, '<td valign="top">Spectacular detail! What patience you must have.</td>', 'Spectacular detail! What patience you must have.', '2007-08-02 15:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962202, 563490, 81852, '<td valign="top">So peaceful. This sparked and interest in me to see just what''s over the hill.</td>', 'So peaceful. This sparked and interest in me to see just what''s over the hill.', '2007-08-02 15:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
