(3962299, 562219, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice place for fishing.  Of course a better time of day would be dusk or dawn for fishing AND for capturing an artistic photograph.  Looks like midday with rather harsh lighting.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Looks like a nice place for fishing.  Of course a better time of day would be dusk or dawn for fishing AND for capturing an artistic photograph.  Looks like midday with rather harsh lighting.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2007-08-02 16:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962301, 563538, 81852, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look comfortable.</td>', 'She doesn''t look comfortable.', '2007-08-02 16:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962306, 563593, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice control of exposure for a challenging lighting environment.  Good use of foreground.  Cute photo - could be a greeting card or tourist brochure photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice control of exposure for a challenging lighting environment.  Good use of foreground.  Cute photo - could be a greeting card or tourist brochure photo.  Well done.', '2007-08-02 16:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962310, 564568, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Nice study in botany.  Not overly exciting as an artistic shot IMO.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  Nice study in botany.  Not overly exciting as an artistic shot IMO.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 16:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962312, 563924, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a great combination of color and subject.  Don''t know if you got lucky or staged this - regardless it''s a shot worth keeping!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'What a great combination of color and subject.  Don''t know if you got lucky or staged this - regardless it''s a shot worth keeping!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 16:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962316, 561836, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the little piece of foreground flower petal tips you''ve pulled into the composition.  Adds some depth and context.  Too bad you didn''t have a couple of white, fluffy clouds to toss in.  :P  May be a tad centered horizontally. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the little piece of foreground flower petal tips you''ve pulled into the composition.  Adds some depth and context.  Too bad you didn''t have a couple of white, fluffy clouds to toss in.  :P  May be a tad centered horizontally. Good luck.', '2007-08-02 16:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962319, 552829, 30049, '<td valign="top">A bit staged, but kinda cute.  Good luck.</td>', 'A bit staged, but kinda cute.  Good luck.', '2007-08-02 16:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962324, 561840, 81852, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-08-02 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962331, 559813, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting group.  Candid, staged, or a combination I wonder?  :)  Hmmm.  Regardless I like the way they all have there hands up.  The older gentleman in the middle adds balance with his brown shoes and darker clothing.  The reflection in the bg adds a nice touch.  Well seen and captured!  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting group.  Candid, staged, or a combination I wonder?  :)  Hmmm.  Regardless I like the way they all have there hands up.  The older gentleman in the middle adds balance with his brown shoes and darker clothing.  The reflection in the bg adds a nice touch.  Well seen and captured!  Good luck.', '2007-08-02 16:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962339, 559444, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and focus on the eyes.  However, I find this extreme closeup unsettling and uncomfortable.</td>', 'Nice clarity and focus on the eyes.  However, I find this extreme closeup unsettling and uncomfortable.', '2007-08-02 16:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962344, 563328, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very colorful sunset.  Personally don''t care for the choice in bordering.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very colorful sunset.  Personally don''t care for the choice in bordering.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-02 16:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962374, 563969, 81852, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is so bright and stunning. She looks like porcelain. I really like it.</td>', 'Wow!  This is so bright and stunning. She looks like porcelain. I really like it.', '2007-08-02 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962375, 557690, 34659, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing...  I love the tones, the emotion, the composition, everything...  WOW...</td>', 'Simply amazing...  I love the tones, the emotion, the composition, everything...  WOW...', '2007-08-02 16:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3962376, 562980, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice siloette, wonder what was so tasty on the stone?</td>', 'Nice siloette, wonder what was so tasty on the stone?', '2007-08-02 16:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
