(3962379, 558891, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  WOW...  Who knew blur could work so well (obviously you did).  I bet you''re one of the people in the August blur side challenge too.  This is a masterpiece.  Well done!</td>', 'This is awesome!  WOW...  Who knew blur could work so well (obviously you did).  I bet you''re one of the people in the August blur side challenge too.  This is a masterpiece.  Well done!', '2007-08-02 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
