(3962382, 563969, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow...  The eyes may be a tad overworked, but there''s no doubt that this is stunning.  We''ll see this near the top for sure.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Wow...  The eyes may be a tad overworked, but there''s no doubt that this is stunning.  We''ll see this near the top for sure.  Beautiful image.', '2007-08-02 16:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
