(3966020, 564406, 30049, '<td valign="top">It will interesting to see where this ends up.  First off, it''s a fun, cute image with a slightly subliminal, leading title.  Is the kid flipping the bird, or he is checking out a fresh boogie on his finger?  I''d guess the second.  :P<br/> <br/>Technically you have a cute engaging subject, with very nice bg bokeh.  The downside is the DOF is a tad short IMO.  This would be stronger with the boy''s face well focused in addition to his hand.  Is the slightly OOF face enough to knock this down a bit in score?  Hmmm.  Find out in less than a week or so.  :D</td>', 'It will interesting to see where this ends up.  First off, it''s a fun, cute image with a slightly subliminal, leading title.  Is the kid flipping the bird, or he is checking out a fresh boogie on his finger?  I''d guess the second.  :P Technically you have a cute engaging subject, with very nice bg bokeh.  The downside is the DOF is a tad short IMO.  This would be stronger with the boy''s face well focused in addition to his hand.  Is the slightly OOF face enough to knock this down a bit in score?  Hmmm.  Find out in less than a week or so.  :D', '2007-08-03 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
