(3966308, 561427, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept.  You may have been going for negative space, but did you look at this with a panoramic (ratio) feel to it?  I think it would have worked quite well.  The clouds are cool...looks like they are right on top of the house.  On my monitor the clouds are a little blown-out.  The lines of the vineyard add nice interest and the house is positioned well within the composition.  I''m noticing some weird artifacts around the clouds and in the lower sky area.  A bit distracting.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice photo.  I hope you have access to this location on a regular basis as it has much potential for other opportunities (seasons, etc...).<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the concept.  You may have been going for negative space, but did you look at this with a panoramic (ratio) feel to it?  I think it would have worked quite well.  The clouds are cool...looks like they are right on top of the house.  On my monitor the clouds are a little blown-out.  The lines of the vineyard add nice interest and the house is positioned well within the composition.  I''m noticing some weird artifacts around the clouds and in the lower sky area.  A bit distracting. Overall a nice photo.  I hope you have access to this location on a regular basis as it has much potential for other opportunities (seasons, etc...). Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966311, 553799, 30049, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Wonderfully captured!</td>', 'Stunning!  Wonderfully captured!', '2007-08-03 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966320, 557995, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice - love the play of light on this.  Only minor complaint from me is the upper left looks artifically gray.  Could have titled this ''early morning magic''.  :)  Wonderfully seen and captured.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice - love the play of light on this.  Only minor complaint from me is the upper left looks artifically gray.  Could have titled this ''early morning magic''.  :)  Wonderfully seen and captured.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966326, 562757, 30049, '<td valign="top">Grunge without the grunge.  :)  I love the rustic feel of this.  Almost looks like you could expect to see horses entering the scene any second.  :P  Well done.  Good luck!</td>', 'Grunge without the grunge.  :)  I love the rustic feel of this.  Almost looks like you could expect to see horses entering the scene any second.  :P  Well done.  Good luck!', '2007-08-03 16:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966335, 552003, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Wish her eyes were a little sharper.  Also feels like a little contrast could be added.  Is it possible to have too much detail in a shot like this?  The photo seems grainy but I think that''s just her skin pores and the netting on the veil doing that.  Looks blotchy in the area under her necklace.<br/> <br/>All of the above is JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice.  Wish her eyes were a little sharper.  Also feels like a little contrast could be added.  Is it possible to have too much detail in a shot like this?  The photo seems grainy but I think that''s just her skin pores and the netting on the veil doing that.  Looks blotchy in the area under her necklace. All of the above is JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966355, 558463, 30049, '<td valign="top">A bit blurry and the highlights are blown a little.  Very cool capture getting the two of them at the same time like this.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A bit blurry and the highlights are blown a little.  Very cool capture getting the two of them at the same time like this. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966359, 563979, 30049, '<td valign="top">Crisp, colorful and frame filling!  :)  f22?  Well done, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Crisp, colorful and frame filling!  :)  f22?  Well done, and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966367, 553734, 30049, '<td valign="top">Darn ripples anyway!  :)  Bit of a cliche shot, but still fun to look at.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Darn ripples anyway!  :)  Bit of a cliche shot, but still fun to look at.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966372, 563796, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love seeing strongly detailed clouds like this.  Only nit from me is it may have been a tad stronger to lower your POV to eliminate the tree tops on the far left.  Overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love seeing strongly detailed clouds like this.  Only nit from me is it may have been a tad stronger to lower your POV to eliminate the tree tops on the far left.  Overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-03 16:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
