(3966479, 559911, 35994, '<td valign="top">Great shot &amp; I LOVE your editing! Looks like something from the old west.</td>', 'Great shot & I LOVE your editing! Looks like something from the old west.', '2007-08-03 17:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966480, 562966, 35994, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl, I love the detail in her eyes.</td>', 'Very pretty girl, I love the detail in her eyes.', '2007-08-03 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966482, 564076, 35994, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about contrasting environments! Neat shot</td>', 'Wow, talk about contrasting environments! Neat shot', '2007-08-03 17:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966487, 564289, 35994, '<td valign="top">Beautiful field!! That looks so wild.</td>', 'Beautiful field!! That looks so wild.', '2007-08-03 17:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966489, 560054, 19978, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. The result is a nearly perfect lightning composition. Tremendously well done!</td>', 'Awesome capture. The result is a nearly perfect lightning composition. Tremendously well done!', '2007-08-03 17:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966495, 563717, 19978, '<td valign="top">Wow, the set of Gilligan''s Island has really gone to hell! On a more serious note, I think this image doesn''t live up to its potential for two reasons: First, the composition is too centered and static. No drama, tension or dynamic at all. Second, the BW conversion leaves it very flat and lacking in contrast. Everything is either very white (boat) or very dark and shadowy (everything else). It really needs some tonal range.</td>', 'Wow, the set of Gilligan''s Island has really gone to hell! On a more serious note, I think this image doesn''t live up to its potential for two reasons: First, the composition is too centered and static. No drama, tension or dynamic at all. Second, the BW conversion leaves it very flat and lacking in contrast. Everything is either very white (boat) or very dark and shadowy (everything else). It really needs some tonal range.', '2007-08-03 17:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966497, 564093, 35994, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, I really like the black &amp; white. Only thing I might''ve changed is to clone out the legs, just an idea though.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, I really like the black & white. Only thing I might''ve changed is to clone out the legs, just an idea though.', '2007-08-03 17:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966508, 559265, 19978, '<td valign="top">A nice capture - my astronomer''s heart is with you - but too dark overall. I want to believe that you could  have pulled more out of this in post processing, but I don''t know what your raw image was like. You''ve got three elements to work with, which is two more than most astrophotographers start with: sky, aurora, and foreground. You''ve got to find a way to really punch one or more of those - detail and some color in the foreground, boosting the contrast and brightness of the aurora, etc. Elinias'' shot is an example:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=438620" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/600/thumb/438620.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/600/thumb/438620.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/600/thumb/438620.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I''ll be back to see who shot this and ponder the details after the challenge ends.</td>', 'A nice capture - my astronomer''s heart is with you - but too dark overall. I want to believe that you could  have pulled more out of this in post processing, but I don''t know what your raw image was like. You''ve got three elements to work with, which is two more than most astrophotographers start with: sky, aurora, and foreground. You''ve got to find a way to really punch one or more of those - detail and some color in the foreground, boosting the contrast and brightness of the aurora, etc. Elinias'' shot is an example:   I''ll be back to see who shot this and ponder the details after the challenge ends.', '2007-08-03 17:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966568, 552270, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. The lighting is wonderful. Not sure this little guy could scare off the bad guys though :)</td>', 'This is excellent. The lighting is wonderful. Not sure this little guy could scare off the bad guys though :)', '2007-08-03 17:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966578, 563602, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is really eye catching. He could be called a shrimp moth too because his "tail" sure looks like one. Great catch.</td>', 'This is really eye catching. He could be called a shrimp moth too because his "tail" sure looks like one. Great catch.', '2007-08-03 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966601, 560612, 889, '<td valign="top">NOW with EXTRA PROTEIN!</td>', 'NOW with EXTRA PROTEIN!', '2007-08-03 18:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
