(3966698, 563216, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!!  This is so amazingly artful.  Dramatic.  A million other superlatives are just under the surface too!  What wonderful detail in the darks and lights.   I love the close composition and the detail in the feathers!  What a great entry you have here!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Oh my!!!  This is so amazingly artful.  Dramatic.  A million other superlatives are just under the surface too!  What wonderful detail in the darks and lights.   I love the close composition and the detail in the feathers!  What a great entry you have here!  Congratulations!', '2007-08-03 19:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966767, 564171, 60495, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but I am not real sure what to make of the boy laying on the beach, he does not look liked he washed up onto the beach because he is to clean and the positioning does not look right. I think the setting is great, the beach has a lot of character, the lighting and DOF are decent but the pose IMO does not quite fit the image. 6</td>', 'Interesting shot but I am not real sure what to make of the boy laying on the beach, he does not look liked he washed up onto the beach because he is to clean and the positioning does not look right. I think the setting is great, the beach has a lot of character, the lighting and DOF are decent but the pose IMO does not quite fit the image. 6', '2007-08-03 19:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3966783, 558690, 60495, '<td valign="top">Must be the angle but I think number 4 won, maybe if he stuck it straight forward...lol</td>', 'Must be the angle but I think number 4 won, maybe if he stuck it straight forward...lol', '2007-08-03 19:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
