(3968060, 550716, 30850, '<td valign="top">Awesome Capture.  The lighting on the butterfly and hand bring you there first and then you see the childs sense of wonder in the background.</td>', 'Awesome Capture.  The lighting on the butterfly and hand bring you there first and then you see the childs sense of wonder in the background.', '2007-08-04 10:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968065, 559387, 30850, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective of Pike</td>', 'Interesting perspective of Pike', '2007-08-04 10:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968066, 555033, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. I especially like the sharpness of the wings. Well done and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice macro. I especially like the sharpness of the wings. Well done and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-04 10:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968068, 562557, 62187, '<td valign="top">The Sky is Crying - and so did I when he died. Very nice observation and lighting.</td>', 'The Sky is Crying - and so did I when he died. Very nice observation and lighting.', '2007-08-04 10:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968069, 555378, 41675, '<td valign="top">Unique structure, but it doesn''t hold my interest for long. I do like the color contrast of the pipes against the sky though.</td>', 'Unique structure, but it doesn''t hold my interest for long. I do like the color contrast of the pipes against the sky though.', '2007-08-04 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968070, 563352, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this. A tough crop, but still very well done.</td>', 'I love the lighting on this. A tough crop, but still very well done.', '2007-08-04 10:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968071, 562928, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this looks like a quick snapshot. Perhaps if I understood the language on the truck it would make more sense to me. Sorry.</td>', 'For me, this looks like a quick snapshot. Perhaps if I understood the language on the truck it would make more sense to me. Sorry.', '2007-08-04 10:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968073, 553566, 30850, '<td valign="top">Great sunset/rise but a boring hill</td>', 'Great sunset/rise but a boring hill', '2007-08-04 10:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968074, 564501, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I especially like the eye. Well done and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I especially like the eye. Well done and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-04 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968075, 562794, 41675, '<td valign="top">LOL - your title makes me chuckle. Good black &amp; white, maybe a little overblown on the right, but still nice.</td>', 'LOL - your title makes me chuckle. Good black & white, maybe a little overblown on the right, but still nice.', '2007-08-04 10:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968076, 557999, 30850, '<td valign="top">Too soft to tell the story here.</td>', 'Too soft to tell the story here.', '2007-08-04 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968077, 558268, 30850, '<td valign="top">Tilted horizon hurt this a bit.  The capture itself is nice.</td>', 'Tilted horizon hurt this a bit.  The capture itself is nice.', '2007-08-04 10:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968078, 563121, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice color portrait. Good composition and lighting. Professionally well done.</td>', 'Nice color portrait. Good composition and lighting. Professionally well done.', '2007-08-04 10:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968079, 562939, 66597, '<td valign="top">Really well done! I love hidden lake - one of the most beautiful places on earth. Hope you had a great trip to Glacier!</td>', 'Really well done! I love hidden lake - one of the most beautiful places on earth. Hope you had a great trip to Glacier!', '2007-08-04 10:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968080, 564629, 41675, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different angle or different time of daylight would add more interest for me. It''s okay, but not real exciting for me.</td>', 'Maybe a different angle or different time of daylight would add more interest for me. It''s okay, but not real exciting for me.', '2007-08-04 10:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968082, 564437, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting!', '2007-08-04 10:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968085, 553922, 30850, '<td valign="top">I like the mist in the background.  The immediate foreground could have been a bit more exposed/sharper to provide some contrast.</td>', 'I like the mist in the background.  The immediate foreground could have been a bit more exposed/sharper to provide some contrast.', '2007-08-04 10:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968086, 564578, 66597, '<td valign="top">Most interesting photo. Not sure about the title, but I really like the b/w conversion.</td>', 'Most interesting photo. Not sure about the title, but I really like the b/w conversion.', '2007-08-04 10:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968087, 554870, 30850, '<td valign="top">A really cool capture.  A bit more crop may have enhanced it.</td>', 'A really cool capture.  A bit more crop may have enhanced it.', '2007-08-04 10:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968109, 555372, 30850, '<td valign="top">Great capture but the blotches below the flower subtract from it.</td>', 'Great capture but the blotches below the flower subtract from it.', '2007-08-04 10:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968112, 559618, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re getting practice for the upside-down challenge :-) Looks like this may have been underexposed, which is leading to some extra redness / patchiness in the skin.</td>', 'Looks like you''re getting practice for the upside-down challenge :-) Looks like this may have been underexposed, which is leading to some extra redness / patchiness in the skin.', '2007-08-04 10:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968113, 549848, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cute - look at those huge eyes! Great catchlights - though maybe the irises could be just a touch whiter? Still, really like it as is.</td>', 'Very cute - look at those huge eyes! Great catchlights - though maybe the irises could be just a touch whiter? Still, really like it as is.', '2007-08-04 10:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968114, 564590, 66597, '<td valign="top">Weird but cool. One of those "I like it but I''m not quite sure why" photos. 7.</td>', 'Weird but cool. One of those "I like it but I''m not quite sure why" photos. 7.', '2007-08-04 10:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968116, 563692, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, bg color compliments flowers well. Looks a touch static, perhaps.</td>', 'Very pretty, bg color compliments flowers well. Looks a touch static, perhaps.', '2007-08-04 10:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968117, 552399, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great candid/street shot! Really like all the textures and layers here</td>', 'Great candid/street shot! Really like all the textures and layers here', '2007-08-04 10:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968119, 561219, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on this one - I like the angle and softness of the veil, but feel the b/w conversion could use some work.</td>', 'I''m torn on this one - I like the angle and softness of the veil, but feel the b/w conversion could use some work.', '2007-08-04 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968121, 553222, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow! What amazing DOF here! The composition is also very strong, albeit unusual. The two sides of the rocks draw eyes right down to the river. Well done.</td>', 'Wow! What amazing DOF here! The composition is also very strong, albeit unusual. The two sides of the rocks draw eyes right down to the river. Well done.', '2007-08-04 11:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968124, 563717, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love old ships - Maine? A tighter crop and more detail on the hull (boat looks blown) would really enhance this IMO.</td>', 'I love old ships - Maine? A tighter crop and more detail on the hull (boat looks blown) would really enhance this IMO.', '2007-08-04 11:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968126, 562218, 66597, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty. Colors could be a bit richer - looks like maybe either a cloud filter in-camera or some color balance tweaking in post might help bring this one out and add more depth.</td>', 'Simple and pretty. Colors could be a bit richer - looks like maybe either a cloud filter in-camera or some color balance tweaking in post might help bring this one out and add more depth.', '2007-08-04 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968130, 563513, 66597, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this! One of the best of the challenge so far. Will add to favorites to revisit and study your excellent composition.</td>', 'Absolutely love this! One of the best of the challenge so far. Will add to favorites to revisit and study your excellent composition.', '2007-08-04 11:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968133, 562587, 66597, '<td valign="top">LOL - love lizards. Still think a tighter crop might be in order here, but do understand you wanted to highlight the camouflage elements.</td>', 'LOL - love lizards. Still think a tighter crop might be in order here, but do understand you wanted to highlight the camouflage elements.', '2007-08-04 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968134, 560157, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love natural window lighting. Hands look a little unnatural, like the brightness doesn''t quite match the extent of highlights on face and hair. Still an interesting shot with great expression.</td>', 'I love natural window lighting. Hands look a little unnatural, like the brightness doesn''t quite match the extent of highlights on face and hair. Still an interesting shot with great expression.', '2007-08-04 11:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968136, 561266, 66597, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking! Wouldn''t be surprised to see this on the front page.</td>', 'Breathtaking! Wouldn''t be surprised to see this on the front page.', '2007-08-04 11:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968138, 562295, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful morning light, love how the grass glows. Mountain area looks a little grainy, but still a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful morning light, love how the grass glows. Mountain area looks a little grainy, but still a beautiful photo.', '2007-08-04 11:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968139, 564134, 28172, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the eyes!</td>', 'Great detail in the eyes!', '2007-08-04 11:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968168, 563969, 28172, '<td valign="top">Stunning! 10</td>', 'Stunning! 10', '2007-08-04 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968169, 555576, 30850, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best night shots of Seattle Ive ever seen</td>', 'This is one of the best night shots of Seattle Ive ever seen', '2007-08-04 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968171, 552832, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting is not very flattering on the boats and it is hard to see the lights of the harbor</td>', 'the lighting is not very flattering on the boats and it is hard to see the lights of the harbor', '2007-08-04 11:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968172, 564242, 67152, '<td valign="top">great looking dog - but the colors are incredible oversaturated</td>', 'great looking dog - but the colors are incredible oversaturated', '2007-08-04 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968173, 561282, 67152, '<td valign="top">has a watercolor feel to it - good effort</td>', 'has a watercolor feel to it - good effort', '2007-08-04 11:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968178, 561248, 67152, '<td valign="top">pretty nice composition, but the colors seem very oversaturated - the sky appears greenish-blue on my monitor</td>', 'pretty nice composition, but the colors seem very oversaturated - the sky appears greenish-blue on my monitor', '2007-08-04 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968180, 564608, 30850, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but horizon is tilted</td>', 'Nice capture but horizon is tilted', '2007-08-04 11:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968181, 553354, 67152, '<td valign="top">really nice composition - the colors are so natural and bright</td>', 'really nice composition - the colors are so natural and bright', '2007-08-04 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968182, 563307, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the smoothness of the photo - maybe a little too smooth but still pretty interesting</td>', 'i like the smoothness of the photo - maybe a little too smooth but still pretty interesting', '2007-08-04 11:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968183, 557770, 30850, '<td valign="top">Overcropped on the top.  The height of the buildings would have been an enhancement here</td>', 'Overcropped on the top.  The height of the buildings would have been an enhancement here', '2007-08-04 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968187, 549212, 30850, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but tilted horizon hurts it a bit</td>', 'Nice shot but tilted horizon hurts it a bit', '2007-08-04 11:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968191, 553486, 76430, '<td valign="top">nice background selective desaturation except for the small desaturated flower in front in the focal plane over the purple flower in back OOF seem to be switched for desat.</td>', 'nice background selective desaturation except for the small desaturated flower in front in the focal plane over the purple flower in back OOF seem to be switched for desat.', '2007-08-04 11:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968193, 557114, 76430, '<td valign="top">There is lens flare, faded colors and not much of real interest in the picture</td>', 'There is lens flare, faded colors and not much of real interest in the picture', '2007-08-04 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968196, 563489, 76430, '<td valign="top">With this title it might be nice to see evidence of it having rained on the flowers even if it''s staged by sprinkling some of the creek water on them.</td>', 'With this title it might be nice to see evidence of it having rained on the flowers even if it''s staged by sprinkling some of the creek water on them.', '2007-08-04 12:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968198, 553922, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice foggy picture.  I was going to comment that it would be nice to have 1 or 2 people in the fog, but then noticed there are 2 people there.  They''re just kind of hard to see.  Maybe capturing them on the back green part of the street would be better.</td>', 'Nice foggy picture.  I was going to comment that it would be nice to have 1 or 2 people in the fog, but then noticed there are 2 people there.  They''re just kind of hard to see.  Maybe capturing them on the back green part of the street would be better.', '2007-08-04 12:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968202, 554506, 76430, '<td valign="top">IMHO it would be a more effective picture if you cropped out most of the brown foreground.  It could either be a panorama then or trim some from left/right to get a more dramatic peak.</td>', 'IMHO it would be a more effective picture if you cropped out most of the brown foreground.  It could either be a panorama then or trim some from left/right to get a more dramatic peak.', '2007-08-04 12:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968207, 563352, 76676, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the lighting.', '2007-08-04 12:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968209, 564272, 76430, '<td valign="top">It would have improved it a lot to wait for the guy taking a snapshot to move away or for you to maybe step forward a step.</td>', 'It would have improved it a lot to wait for the guy taking a snapshot to move away or for you to maybe step forward a step.', '2007-08-04 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3968212, 563952, 76430, '<td valign="top">It does show distance but I would like to see the whole hummingbird in frame.  Good bokeh.</td>', 'It does show distance but I would like to see the whole hummingbird in frame.  Good bokeh.', '2007-08-04 12:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968214, 561371, 76676, '<td valign="top">Fantastic dog portrait. I love the eye. Nice work.</td>', 'Fantastic dog portrait. I love the eye. Nice work.', '2007-08-04 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968215, 562369, 76430, '<td valign="top">Spectacular cloud formation.  Polarizing filter?</td>', 'Spectacular cloud formation.  Polarizing filter?', '2007-08-04 12:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968217, 550063, 76430, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower and good angle, but it doesn''t seem as sharp or saturated as it could be.</td>', 'Pretty flower and good angle, but it doesn''t seem as sharp or saturated as it could be.', '2007-08-04 12:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968236, 563349, 76430, '<td valign="top">The only thing in focus is the center horse head, and that matches the title.  Great action shot.</td>', 'The only thing in focus is the center horse head, and that matches the title.  Great action shot.', '2007-08-04 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968239, 563586, 76430, '<td valign="top">The walls are great, but the vantage point of Machu Picchu being below the other mountain range hurts this one.  Maybe if you were down a level where the other man-made structures are it would be improved with Machu Picchu being over everything else.</td>', 'The walls are great, but the vantage point of Machu Picchu being below the other mountain range hurts this one.  Maybe if you were down a level where the other man-made structures are it would be improved with Machu Picchu being over everything else.', '2007-08-04 12:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968242, 561744, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice complementary coloring and saturation as well as bokeh.</td>', 'Nice complementary coloring and saturation as well as bokeh.', '2007-08-04 12:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968252, 563691, 76430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what''s behind Hut''s, but I think the angle from the street with the uncropped Hut''s sign being over the restaurant and missing the SUV, liquor store and tall buildings in the background would be more effective.</td>', 'I don''t know what''s behind Hut''s, but I think the angle from the street with the uncropped Hut''s sign being over the restaurant and missing the SUV, liquor store and tall buildings in the background would be more effective.', '2007-08-04 12:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968253, 562224, 76430, '<td valign="top">Those first steps can be dangerous.  Creative shot.</td>', 'Those first steps can be dangerous.  Creative shot.', '2007-08-04 12:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968257, 560636, 60173, '<td valign="top">In a quick click you''ve managed to capture a great story.<br/> <br/>You did a good job framing the photo''s composition, giving them room in the photo to gaze into the distance. Black and white was a good choice. When I first saw this image I got a very classic Ansel Adams feel.<br/> <br/>One thing that is really distracting me in the photo is the little weed/tree that''s sprouting on the hill. I would have cloned that out.</td>', 'In a quick click you''ve managed to capture a great story. You did a good job framing the photo''s composition, giving them room in the photo to gaze into the distance. Black and white was a good choice. When I first saw this image I got a very classic Ansel Adams feel. One thing that is really distracting me in the photo is the little weed/tree that''s sprouting on the hill. I would have cloned that out.', '2007-08-04 12:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968258, 562102, 76430, '<td valign="top">This would have been a much better picture imho with better lighting.  It''s a great scene composed well.</td>', 'This would have been a much better picture imho with better lighting.  It''s a great scene composed well.', '2007-08-04 12:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968262, 554075, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s some very strange things going on with your border that distract from the photo.</td>', 'There''s some very strange things going on with your border that distract from the photo.', '2007-08-04 12:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968279, 563576, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors, but very grainy.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors, but very grainy.', '2007-08-04 12:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968284, 563513, 19944, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Hate the title.  "Dolly Diamonds in High Key" would have probably sufficed.</td>', 'Great shot.  Hate the title.  "Dolly Diamonds in High Key" would have probably sufficed.', '2007-08-04 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968293, 551030, 19944, '<td valign="top">Without reading the title, I knew this was probably Cadillac Mountain.  It''s quite a view.  I''ve never done sunrise, but have done sunset there.  Maybe next time I go back.<br/> <br/>Your horizon looks like it''s got a slight tilt to it.  It could just be perceptual, but it still seems to be there.  I have a have a favorite spot to shoot and I get the "perceptual tilt" all the time, even though the cammera is completely level.</td>', 'Without reading the title, I knew this was probably Cadillac Mountain.  It''s quite a view.  I''ve never done sunrise, but have done sunset there.  Maybe next time I go back. Your horizon looks like it''s got a slight tilt to it.  It could just be perceptual, but it still seems to be there.  I have a have a favorite spot to shoot and I get the "perceptual tilt" all the time, even though the cammera is completely level.', '2007-08-04 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968294, 564479, 60173, '<td valign="top">While the post processing on this seems to be done well and I love the depth it gives to the wee one, I don''t personally think it''s a good post proccesing technique for a family photo.<br/> <br/>The photo is nice. The processing is nice. I just don''t like them together.</td>', 'While the post processing on this seems to be done well and I love the depth it gives to the wee one, I don''t personally think it''s a good post proccesing technique for a family photo. The photo is nice. The processing is nice. I just don''t like them together.', '2007-08-04 12:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968299, 555598, 19944, '<td valign="top">Very 20''s-ish.  Puts me in a silent film state of mind.  Perhaps that''s what you were going for.  Is so, you succeeded.</td>', 'Very 20''s-ish.  Puts me in a silent film state of mind.  Perhaps that''s what you were going for.  Is so, you succeeded.', '2007-08-04 12:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968315, 564631, 60173, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice, but I fear the slant of your horizon is lessening the impact. There''s also a glob of sensor dust under the right glass, heh.<br/> <br/>I think the technique used to shoot the photo is well done. Great lighting. The post processing just needs a little tweeking.</td>', 'The colors are very nice, but I fear the slant of your horizon is lessening the impact. There''s also a glob of sensor dust under the right glass, heh. I think the technique used to shoot the photo is well done. Great lighting. The post processing just needs a little tweeking.', '2007-08-04 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968329, 554870, 19944, '<td valign="top">Sure wish this were bigger.  As small as it is, I really like it, but you wasted about 34,320 pixels.</td>', 'Sure wish this were bigger.  As small as it is, I really like it, but you wasted about 34,320 pixels.', '2007-08-04 13:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968332, 563559, 60173, '<td valign="top">Colors and crop are nice, but she just doesn''t look comfortable.</td>', 'Colors and crop are nice, but she just doesn''t look comfortable.', '2007-08-04 13:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968353, 562939, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo and location, but your shadows are very very dark.</td>', 'Beautiful photo and location, but your shadows are very very dark.', '2007-08-04 13:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968363, 560372, 60173, '<td valign="top">The edges of your flower are very jagged. I would blur or smudge those edges to make them blend better.</td>', 'The edges of your flower are very jagged. I would blur or smudge those edges to make them blend better.', '2007-08-04 13:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968367, 555332, 54228, '<td valign="top">This has a bit of a front page air to it... very nice detail and control of highlights. A little out of focus, though, I think. 8</td>', 'This has a bit of a front page air to it... very nice detail and control of highlights. A little out of focus, though, I think. 8', '2007-08-04 13:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968377, 562928, 30850, '<td valign="top">Jeg forsta ikke den foto?</td>', 'Jeg forsta ikke den foto?', '2007-08-04 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968380, 549550, 54228, '<td valign="top">Your colours are great here, but perhaps a slightly closer crop to bring out some more detail? 6</td>', 'Your colours are great here, but perhaps a slightly closer crop to bring out some more detail? 6', '2007-08-04 13:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968383, 563951, 54228, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of this kind of shot, but it seems to be somewhere in between a wide and close crop, it feels a little awkward. 5</td>', 'I''m a big fan of this kind of shot, but it seems to be somewhere in between a wide and close crop, it feels a little awkward. 5', '2007-08-04 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968386, 559404, 26464, '<td valign="top">amazing light, almost looks like a gradient filter? either way, 7</td>', 'amazing light, almost looks like a gradient filter? either way, 7', '2007-08-04 13:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968387, 561769, 73250, '<td valign="top">I like this, but think it needs more room on both the bottom and top.</td>', 'I like this, but think it needs more room on both the bottom and top.', '2007-08-04 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968389, 563856, 54228, '<td valign="top">Great action moment and very good contrast here.</td>', 'Great action moment and very good contrast here.', '2007-08-04 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968393, 564303, 54228, '<td valign="top">Despite your title eluding to early morning, this doesn''t have that feel. It''s a reasonable composition with good lines, but it could do with a much more distinct point of interest. 6</td>', 'Despite your title eluding to early morning, this doesn''t have that feel. It''s a reasonable composition with good lines, but it could do with a much more distinct point of interest. 6', '2007-08-04 13:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968398, 559401, 54228, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and colours. I find myself wondering what it would look like without the big black patch on the left, though. Perhaps a crop is in order. 6</td>', 'Nice capture and colours. I find myself wondering what it would look like without the big black patch on the left, though. Perhaps a crop is in order. 6', '2007-08-04 13:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
