(3968788, 559234, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the selective desat works very well.  However, I think the DOF is much too shallow or in the wrong place.  The OOF roses in the foreground are very distracting and I think increasing the DOF or shifting it to include the foreground roses would work much better.</td>', 'I like the idea and the selective desat works very well.  However, I think the DOF is much too shallow or in the wrong place.  The OOF roses in the foreground are very distracting and I think increasing the DOF or shifting it to include the foreground roses would work much better.', '2007-08-04 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968793, 560009, 56502, '<td valign="top">I find the objects in the foreground somewhat distracting. Apart from that, very nice.</td>', 'I find the objects in the foreground somewhat distracting. Apart from that, very nice.', '2007-08-04 16:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3968802, 563559, 56502, '<td valign="top">On my monitor there is hardly any contrast between her left cheek and her neck. I think that would look better if the picture were a bit darker. (I guess then it get''s difficult on her right side, but these are just my thoughts.) In any event a nice portrait.</td>', 'On my monitor there is hardly any contrast between her left cheek and her neck. I think that would look better if the picture were a bit darker. (I guess then it get''s difficult on her right side, but these are just my thoughts.) In any event a nice portrait.', '2007-08-04 16:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
