(3970296, 562217, 67152, '<td valign="top">beautiful vista - wish there was better and more dramatic lighting.  i think this one could use a little more localized contrast and some sharpening - but I wouldn''t touch the color - it is very realistic!</td>', 'beautiful vista - wish there was better and more dramatic lighting.  i think this one could use a little more localized contrast and some sharpening - but I wouldn''t touch the color - it is very realistic!', '2007-08-05 09:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
