(3970304, 563012, 67152, '<td valign="top">very good use of subdued greys - but there is something very strange happening when I look at the image on my screen - there is a very significant digital artifact of subtle circles starting in the middle of the image and going out - not sure what happened to create this, but if others see it, your score is probably going to suffer</td>', 'very good use of subdued greys - but there is something very strange happening when I look at the image on my screen - there is a very significant digital artifact of subtle circles starting in the middle of the image and going out - not sure what happened to create this, but if others see it, your score is probably going to suffer', '2007-08-05 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3970305, 549463, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice lighting but the movement of the boats makes it look a little blurry</td>', 'nice lighting but the movement of the boats makes it look a little blurry', '2007-08-05 09:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
