(3973447, 562177, 24613, '<td valign="top">I''ve said this before and I''ll say it again...it''s not fair that you have the prettiest model on DPC!  Another excellent shot of her that should score high in this challenge.  The leeding lines are great, the DOF is perfect, and the model is sooo photogenic (as always).  Nice work here! 9</td>', 'I''ve said this before and I''ll say it again...it''s not fair that you have the prettiest model on DPC!  Another excellent shot of her that should score high in this challenge.  The leeding lines are great, the DOF is perfect, and the model is sooo photogenic (as always).  Nice work here! 9', '2007-08-06 09:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973458, 559054, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Looks like a Corona commercial. :) 8</td>', 'Very nice!  Looks like a Corona commercial. :) 8', '2007-08-06 09:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973462, 564324, 24613, '<td valign="top">VERY nice stop-action shot.  Good work! 8</td>', 'VERY nice stop-action shot.  Good work! 8', '2007-08-06 09:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973468, 550716, 24613, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! 9</td>', 'Excellent capture! 9', '2007-08-06 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973491, 563536, 24613, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite places in the world!  The sky usually won''t cooperate with me when I''m there!  Very nice work here and a great example of how to make the suggestion of thirds really work well in the composition. Of course, capturing the light "on" is a must. :) 10</td>', 'One of my favorite places in the world!  The sky usually won''t cooperate with me when I''m there!  Very nice work here and a great example of how to make the suggestion of thirds really work well in the composition. Of course, capturing the light "on" is a must. :) 10', '2007-08-06 09:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973502, 555422, 24613, '<td valign="top">A butterfly with a nose ring...cool! 9</td>', 'A butterfly with a nose ring...cool! 9', '2007-08-06 09:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973612, 563960, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and drama.  A very calm and peaceful scene.  Great photo!</td>', 'Very nice light and drama.  A very calm and peaceful scene.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 10:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973614, 558268, 42100, '<td valign="top">That silhouette really pops against those great orange tones.  Very moody scene.  Great photo!</td>', 'That silhouette really pops against those great orange tones.  Very moody scene.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973618, 562251, 42100, '<td valign="top">This seems so much more understated than many of the dragonfly photos I''ve seen recently, definitely much more elegant.  Wonderful light and tones.  Great photo!</td>', 'This seems so much more understated than many of the dragonfly photos I''ve seen recently, definitely much more elegant.  Wonderful light and tones.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 10:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973656, 563632, 42100, '<td valign="top">A unique and beautiful scene.  The light and colors are very endearing.  Great photo!</td>', 'A unique and beautiful scene.  The light and colors are very endearing.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 10:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973666, 562067, 42100, '<td valign="top">Outstanding light...some amazing tones and highlights.  With those eyes you feel like you can see into his soul.  Great photo!</td>', 'Outstanding light...some amazing tones and highlights.  With those eyes you feel like you can see into his soul.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 10:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973673, 552270, 42100, '<td valign="top">I think this one has to be my favorite of the challenge.  The spotlighting on your subjects is excellent and the composition is very dynamic.<br/> <br/>...and of course, how can you resist those eyes!  Great photo!</td>', 'I think this one has to be my favorite of the challenge.  The spotlighting on your subjects is excellent and the composition is very dynamic. ...and of course, how can you resist those eyes!  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 10:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973745, 564355, 889, '<td valign="top">Interesting Portrait, problem is we see where he has been, not where he is going/looking. The later is much more interesting. I do give you a point for using the bush to provide a close backdrop. If you had instead Done a light blur that would have worked as well, even if you didn''t have the DOF figured correctly.  you may want to experiment with single spot focus since this has a snap-shotty feel.  I also thank you for shooting this from lower, rather than at head height looking down.</td>', 'Interesting Portrait, problem is we see where he has been, not where he is going/looking. The later is much more interesting. I do give you a point for using the bush to provide a close backdrop. If you had instead Done a light blur that would have worked as well, even if you didn''t have the DOF figured correctly.  you may want to experiment with single spot focus since this has a snap-shotty feel.  I also thank you for shooting this from lower, rather than at head height looking down.', '2007-08-06 11:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973812, 553840, 889, '<td valign="top">So calm.  If you could have, going with less sky would have been better. Then without the writing you could have rotates the picture 180 and let people guess which was the real reflection.</td>', 'So calm.  If you could have, going with less sky would have been better. Then without the writing you could have rotates the picture 180 and let people guess which was the real reflection.', '2007-08-06 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973819, 555576, 889, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what is special about the lit white building in the lower right corner. Knocking that down in brightness and moving the needle in about 50% more than it is would have worked well. I probably would have dodged the apartment complex in the foreground as well. This was an Advanced challenge.</td>', 'I don''t know what is special about the lit white building in the lower right corner. Knocking that down in brightness and moving the needle in about 50% more than it is would have worked well. I probably would have dodged the apartment complex in the foreground as well. This was an Advanced challenge.', '2007-08-06 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973860, 557847, 889, '<td valign="top">nice, if it wasn''t for the overhanging tree I would have said to shoot more up.  if you go back, try getting lower and shooting up.  This would give you the bow, the large dark rock on the left, and add in the mountain behind with some of the sky. The tree then maybe would have been in about the same place if not higher and not as much of an issue.</td>', 'nice, if it wasn''t for the overhanging tree I would have said to shoot more up.  if you go back, try getting lower and shooting up.  This would give you the bow, the large dark rock on the left, and add in the mountain behind with some of the sky. The tree then maybe would have been in about the same place if not higher and not as much of an issue.', '2007-08-06 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973883, 554334, 42100, '<td valign="top">The man''s interaction with the pigeons really takes this portrait to the next level.  The tight crop works well and the clarity of details is excellent.  Great photo!</td>', 'The man''s interaction with the pigeons really takes this portrait to the next level.  The tight crop works well and the clarity of details is excellent.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 12:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973886, 556788, 42100, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of my favorites of this challenge.  The tones and texture are exquisite and quite moody.  Great photo!</td>', 'Definitely one of my favorites of this challenge.  The tones and texture are exquisite and quite moody.  Great photo!', '2007-08-06 12:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973893, 561744, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very bright, attention getting color...the clarity is also quite outstanding.  Beautiful butterfly and photograph!</td>', 'Very bright, attention getting color...the clarity is also quite outstanding.  Beautiful butterfly and photograph!', '2007-08-06 12:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973904, 564156, 42100, '<td valign="top">Just by the nature of the distances involved, air show photos are usually so stale, static, and really not much of interest beyond the planes themselves.  This is none of those and so much more.  The textures, tones and composition are pure wow!</td>', 'Just by the nature of the distances involved, air show photos are usually so stale, static, and really not much of interest beyond the planes themselves.  This is none of those and so much more.  The textures, tones and composition are pure wow!', '2007-08-06 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973951, 563783, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems a little stiff?  :P  Kind of a documentary type shot - very static.  Did you consider other materials to place the bug on?  Some sand may have worked better if you''re wanting people to wonder if it''s alive or not.  Dirt and leaves maybe even better.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Seems a little stiff?  :P  Kind of a documentary type shot - very static.  Did you consider other materials to place the bug on?  Some sand may have worked better if you''re wanting people to wonder if it''s alive or not.  Dirt and leaves maybe even better.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973957, 564461, 30049, '<td valign="top">Holy color saturation Batman!  :)  Family pet?  Hard to tell, which is good.  Nice idea and overall well captured.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Holy color saturation Batman!  :)  Family pet?  Hard to tell, which is good.  Nice idea and overall well captured.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973959, 561782, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now here''s a photo that needs to be framed and kept forever.  :)  Wonderful image.  The setting is perfect, the technicals are good, and the bg bokeh is very nice.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Now here''s a photo that needs to be framed and kept forever.  :)  Wonderful image.  The setting is perfect, the technicals are good, and the bg bokeh is very nice.  Great job!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973962, 564084, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color in the reflections.  Kind of neat how the water above the break is nearly the same color as the bird.  Good catch!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful color in the reflections.  Kind of neat how the water above the break is nearly the same color as the bird.  Good catch!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973965, 563397, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice catchlight in the eye.  Good color and exposure overall.  The photo could be sharper and a small boost in contrast would also help this some.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice catchlight in the eye.  Good color and exposure overall.  The photo could be sharper and a small boost in contrast would also help this some.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973971, 562918, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  A macro macro.  That bug is TINY!  Looks like you''re just at the edge of the focal plane for the shallow DOF.  Tricky I''m sure!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  A macro macro.  That bug is TINY!  Looks like you''re just at the edge of the focal plane for the shallow DOF.  Tricky I''m sure!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973973, 564539, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice diagonals in this strongly composed image.  Love the fog.  Something about the PP seems a little overcooked.  Almost has a painterly feel to it now as the details in the evergreen, roadway, and treebark seem to blend in (smoothed out).  Great eye to see this and capture it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice diagonals in this strongly composed image.  Love the fog.  Something about the PP seems a little overcooked.  Almost has a painterly feel to it now as the details in the evergreen, roadway, and treebark seem to blend in (smoothed out).  Great eye to see this and capture it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 12:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973983, 563844, 30049, '<td valign="top">Darn Michiganders and their Great Lakes!!!  :D  Makes me a tad homesick.<br/> <br/>Wonderful play of light and color here in this.  Well done!</td>', 'Darn Michiganders and their Great Lakes!!!  :D  Makes me a tad homesick. Wonderful play of light and color here in this.  Well done!', '2007-08-06 12:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3973998, 562333, 58691, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of this image, I think the short color really enhances the overall effect.</td>', 'I like the tone of this image, I think the short color really enhances the overall effect.', '2007-08-06 13:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974001, 564631, 67152, '<td valign="top">great contrast and colors - but the sensor dust, speck and the tilted glasses distract</td>', 'great contrast and colors - but the sensor dust, speck and the tilted glasses distract', '2007-08-06 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974011, 563390, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; the color is just a little too flat</td>', 'Nice shot; the color is just a little too flat', '2007-08-06 13:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974014, 564604, 67152, '<td valign="top">pretty sky and great use of realistic colors - the issue I have is the fence dead center - i would prefer it to either side instead of in the middle - it makes we want to move over so I can see what is behind the shrub</td>', 'pretty sky and great use of realistic colors - the issue I have is the fence dead center - i would prefer it to either side instead of in the middle - it makes we want to move over so I can see what is behind the shrub', '2007-08-06 13:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974017, 564355, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  How''d you do that?  Tom is standing straight, yet the lake in the bg looks to be substantially tilted left (looking at the far shoreline).  Hmmm.<br/> <br/>From an artistic POV this photo feels a bit like a snapshot.  Nothing personal.  Something more interesting like a low angle that takes in the sword and Tom''s face may have better scoring potential.  It''s like you tried to incorporate too much into this composition.  <br/> <br/>The broody sky could have worked in your favor with some different PP; as is, it''s a tad washed out in the highlights.<br/> <br/>Just some observations, and obviously JMO.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  How''d you do that?  Tom is standing straight, yet the lake in the bg looks to be substantially tilted left (looking at the far shoreline).  Hmmm. From an artistic POV this photo feels a bit like a snapshot.  Nothing personal.  Something more interesting like a low angle that takes in the sword and Tom''s face may have better scoring potential.  It''s like you tried to incorporate too much into this composition.   The broody sky could have worked in your favor with some different PP; as is, it''s a tad washed out in the highlights. Just some observations, and obviously JMO.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974022, 564392, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun play on light and shadows.  Warmup for the Shadows challenge?  :D  I like it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fun play on light and shadows.  Warmup for the Shadows challenge?  :D  I like it.  Good luck.', '2007-08-06 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974024, 564221, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun and wonderfully processed!  Smile looks a tad contrived, but overall a very nice capture.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is fun and wonderfully processed!  Smile looks a tad contrived, but overall a very nice capture.  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-06 13:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974025, 563200, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderful vista - the colors are really well captured  - but the positioning, angle, and ''pose'' of the woman doesn''t work for me</td>', 'wonderful vista - the colors are really well captured  - but the positioning, angle, and ''pose'' of the woman doesn''t work for me', '2007-08-06 13:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974030, 564355, 67152, '<td valign="top">the costume and location look really good but the centered positioning of "Lt Tom" is very static and the blown out sky in the background does not add a lot. i would imagine that by placing him in the left hand side of the image - still looking the same way - we can see what he is looking at and get a better image.</td>', 'the costume and location look really good but the centered positioning of "Lt Tom" is very static and the blown out sky in the background does not add a lot. i would imagine that by placing him in the left hand side of the image - still looking the same way - we can see what he is looking at and get a better image.', '2007-08-06 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974034, 563652, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent detail in this great building - but the sky really does not add much to the image</td>', 'excellent detail in this great building - but the sky really does not add much to the image', '2007-08-06 13:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
