(3974180, 562430, 42100, '<td valign="top">The golden tones are great, especially  with all the layered silhouettes.  This scene really elicits a warm and cozy feeling.  Beautiful photograph!</td>', 'The golden tones are great, especially  with all the layered silhouettes.  This scene really elicits a warm and cozy feeling.  Beautiful photograph!', '2007-08-06 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974217, 557445, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  They seem uncomfortable, especially the man.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  They seem uncomfortable, especially the man.', '2007-08-06 14:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974223, 562224, 33400, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  This is definitely a little twisted.  Nice execution though (pardon the pun...)<br/>The shoes are a little over exposed, but I bet you had to do that to get the smoke to show clearly.</td>', 'Yikes.  This is definitely a little twisted.  Nice execution though (pardon the pun...)The shoes are a little over exposed, but I bet you had to do that to get the smoke to show clearly.', '2007-08-06 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974228, 562177, 43156, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting.</td>', 'Perfect lighting.', '2007-08-06 14:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974233, 563121, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl, interesting make-up.  Makes me wonder what it''s about.<br/>I''m learning that sharper eyes can really make the portrait.  Her eyes here are nice, but not quite as sharp as the mouth.  Given her expression, I don''t thing you want a softer look on the lips, but I bet if you made the eyes pop just a little more this would be a really great photo.</td>', 'Very pretty girl, interesting make-up.  Makes me wonder what it''s about.I''m learning that sharper eyes can really make the portrait.  Her eyes here are nice, but not quite as sharp as the mouth.  Given her expression, I don''t thing you want a softer look on the lips, but I bet if you made the eyes pop just a little more this would be a really great photo.', '2007-08-06 14:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974250, 557450, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and clarity...your subjects really pop nicely from the background circle bokeh.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice color and clarity...your subjects really pop nicely from the background circle bokeh.  Well done!', '2007-08-06 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974256, 564112, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic job of framing and composing this...great use of DOF as well.  Great job!</td>', 'Very dynamic job of framing and composing this...great use of DOF as well.  Great job!', '2007-08-06 14:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974261, 561914, 42100, '<td valign="top">Sheez...I don''t think it would be possible to get any better clarity than this!  Very nice...and great use of DOF as well!</td>', 'Sheez...I don''t think it would be possible to get any better clarity than this!  Very nice...and great use of DOF as well!', '2007-08-06 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974293, 559813, 889, '<td valign="top">It is funny, the white guy in the middle is STILL leaning away from the black guy just a little.</td>', 'It is funny, the white guy in the middle is STILL leaning away from the black guy just a little.', '2007-08-06 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974305, 564379, 889, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a Viking Longboat.  I think it would look better cropped so the sculpture is in the lower right, this would give the impression that it is about to sail away into the vast expanse</td>', 'This reminds me of a Viking Longboat.  I think it would look better cropped so the sculpture is in the lower right, this would give the impression that it is about to sail away into the vast expanse', '2007-08-06 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974309, 561147, 78455, '<td valign="top">The sea looks like a sheet of molten metal, and the whole image has a metallic feel to it; unusual, but I like it!</td>', 'The sea looks like a sheet of molten metal, and the whole image has a metallic feel to it; unusual, but I like it!', '2007-08-06 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974313, 562746, 78455, '<td valign="top">beutiful portrait and such clarity and sharpness: a favourite, 8.</td>', 'beutiful portrait and such clarity and sharpness: a favourite, 8.', '2007-08-06 15:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974320, 563844, 78455, '<td valign="top">Absolutelly stunning; nuff said, 9 and a clear favourite of this challenge thus far!</td>', 'Absolutelly stunning; nuff said, 9 and a clear favourite of this challenge thus far!', '2007-08-06 15:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3974331, 564408, 68956, '<td valign="top">Beautifully ugly :)</td>', 'Beautifully ugly :)', '2007-08-06 15:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
