(3975411, 564162, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old faded print from film. If this was your intent, well done! I like the subjects, and the story they tell.</td>', 'Looks like an old faded print from film. If this was your intent, well done! I like the subjects, and the story they tell.', '2007-08-06 22:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975412, 564229, 67697, '<td valign="top">Heh - great title.  Interesting moment. Love the rich red color.</td>', 'Heh - great title.  Interesting moment. Love the rich red color.', '2007-08-06 22:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975445, 555965, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a pleasing pastoral scene! I can''t think of a single suggestion to improve.</td>', 'Wow! What a pleasing pastoral scene! I can''t think of a single suggestion to improve.', '2007-08-06 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975450, 560000, 18197, '<td valign="top">A bit more mid-tone contrast might improve this. Otherwise, nice capture.</td>', 'A bit more mid-tone contrast might improve this. Otherwise, nice capture.', '2007-08-06 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975454, 563152, 18197, '<td valign="top">A fine photo diminished by oversharpening of foreground subject (IMHO).</td>', 'A fine photo diminished by oversharpening of foreground subject (IMHO).', '2007-08-06 23:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975455, 563873, 42100, '<td valign="top">A strong display of character and represented in this photo...at least that what''s I''m getting out of it.  Very nice color and clarity.  Well done!</td>', 'A strong display of character and represented in this photo...at least that what''s I''m getting out of it.  Very nice color and clarity.  Well done!', '2007-08-06 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975463, 555576, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the city I call home! Classic!</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the city I call home! Classic!', '2007-08-06 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975466, 559437, 18197, '<td valign="top">UnappealinG, at least to mE.</td>', 'UnappealinG, at least to mE.', '2007-08-06 23:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975469, 562224, 18197, '<td valign="top">At least the sense of humor survives at DPC. Made me laugh.</td>', 'At least the sense of humor survives at DPC. Made me laugh.', '2007-08-06 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975472, 558804, 69556, '<td valign="top">too Busy</td>', 'too Busy', '2007-08-06 23:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975479, 551168, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great looking mountain goat...the mid stride capture looks good.  Excellent backdrop as well.  Very nice!</td>', 'Great looking mountain goat...the mid stride capture looks good.  Excellent backdrop as well.  Very nice!', '2007-08-06 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975483, 564435, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy looking spiderweb...beautiful color and tone.  Well done!</td>', 'Very dreamy looking spiderweb...beautiful color and tone.  Well done!', '2007-08-06 23:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975500, 561740, 889, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is Levy''s picture, ha ha, I can see why people wondered.  My Guess this could be a long time Exposure shot you could have shot one, switched to a different zoom setting and uncovered the lens. Just like the shot of the Jefferson and two Washington Memorials that was talked about in a tutorial.<br/> <br/>Heck if atmospherics are just right you can get this effect close to the horizon. without any camera games!</td>', 'I wonder if this is Levy''s picture, ha ha, I can see why people wondered.  My Guess this could be a long time Exposure shot you could have shot one, switched to a different zoom setting and uncovered the lens. Just like the shot of the Jefferson and two Washington Memorials that was talked about in a tutorial. Heck if atmospherics are just right you can get this effect close to the horizon. without any camera games!', '2007-08-06 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975505, 563586, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice workmanlike photo, but the last time I was there I seem to remember many other more dramatic points of view. Maybe shortening the photo by eliminating some of the upper sky would improve it?</td>', 'Nice workmanlike photo, but the last time I was there I seem to remember many other more dramatic points of view. Maybe shortening the photo by eliminating some of the upper sky would improve it?', '2007-08-06 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975513, 562284, 18197, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo in a photo-journalism sort of way. Well done. Tells a story. Feels "real" in a way a lot of photos here do not!</td>', 'Really nice photo in a photo-journalism sort of way. Well done. Tells a story. Feels "real" in a way a lot of photos here do not!', '2007-08-06 23:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975526, 555563, 18197, '<td valign="top">The post procesing would normally be beyond my tolerance, but here, it''s done so well, I really like it. Brilliant. It feels tipped slightly to the right, a pet peeve of mine.</td>', 'The post procesing would normally be beyond my tolerance, but here, it''s done so well, I really like it. Brilliant. It feels tipped slightly to the right, a pet peeve of mine.', '2007-08-06 23:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975530, 563975, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice execution of this oft-captured subject. Love the crater at the terminator and the texture at the bottom!!!</td>', 'Very nice execution of this oft-captured subject. Love the crater at the terminator and the texture at the bottom!!!', '2007-08-06 23:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975531, 562067, 50695, '<td valign="top">this looks too polished for the subject matter.</td>', 'this looks too polished for the subject matter.', '2007-08-06 23:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975534, 560619, 889, '<td valign="top">The square trimmed nail is a nice touch, I don''t know if she wears them that way all the time, but the sudden ending of the finger is great. The only downside, and I''m not requesting validation, is that the hat doesn''t look like it is on her head, but in front of it.  I would expect the hair to be pinched in a bit. The hat may be large, but that is how it looks</td>', 'The square trimmed nail is a nice touch, I don''t know if she wears them that way all the time, but the sudden ending of the finger is great. The only downside, and I''m not requesting validation, is that the hat doesn''t look like it is on her head, but in front of it.  I would expect the hair to be pinched in a bit. The hat may be large, but that is how it looks', '2007-08-06 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975540, 564496, 18197, '<td valign="top">I dislike any photo which glorifies smoking. Please inform your model she''s killing herself and others around her. I guess this is personal. My mother died from smoking-induced emphasema. 1 from me.</td>', 'I dislike any photo which glorifies smoking. Please inform your model she''s killing herself and others around her. I guess this is personal. My mother died from smoking-induced emphasema. 1 from me.', '2007-08-06 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975547, 551035, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the reflected corvette. Creative!</td>', 'Love the reflected corvette. Creative!', '2007-08-06 23:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975550, 555280, 18197, '<td valign="top">"We will fight for bovine freedom, and hold our large heads high ..." Wouldn''t normally like this sort of photo but it''s so well done I can''t help but like it. Thanks for daring to be out-of-the-box!</td>', '"We will fight for bovine freedom, and hold our large heads high ..." Wouldn''t normally like this sort of photo but it''s so well done I can''t help but like it. Thanks for daring to be out-of-the-box!', '2007-08-06 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975561, 563307, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great clarity here. Nice focus. Good saturation. Feels like you may have oversone noise reduction, ... but maybe this was actually that smooth. I would be proud to have taken this photo.</td>', 'Great clarity here. Nice focus. Good saturation. Feels like you may have oversone noise reduction, ... but maybe this was actually that smooth. I would be proud to have taken this photo.', '2007-08-06 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975563, 563670, 50695, '<td valign="top">I find the colors distracting. I bet this is brilliant in black and white.</td>', 'I find the colors distracting. I bet this is brilliant in black and white.', '2007-08-06 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975564, 556084, 40019, '<td valign="top">Looks like the walk to the Point Reyes Lighthouse to me. :-)  Nice image!</td>', 'Looks like the walk to the Point Reyes Lighthouse to me. :-)  Nice image!', '2007-08-06 23:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975566, 564421, 50695, '<td valign="top">the reflection is pixelated near the horizon... just kidding! that''s actually my favorite part.</td>', 'the reflection is pixelated near the horizon... just kidding! that''s actually my favorite part.', '2007-08-06 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975576, 561491, 889, '<td valign="top">You need to be careful about spherical aberrations when working on a really wide angle shot. The barn is leaning towards the house because the foreground line is curving up at the ends. usually focusing in and stepping back can take care of it.</td>', 'You need to be careful about spherical aberrations when working on a really wide angle shot. The barn is leaning towards the house because the foreground line is curving up at the ends. usually focusing in and stepping back can take care of it.', '2007-08-06 23:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975579, 564524, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am an aviation enthusiast and this is a great capture. Well done. I like that you have preserved the detail of the jets. It is interesting to me that there seems to be more detail in the older jets ... maybe less attention to reducing drag.</td>', 'I am an aviation enthusiast and this is a great capture. Well done. I like that you have preserved the detail of the jets. It is interesting to me that there seems to be more detail in the older jets ... maybe less attention to reducing drag.', '2007-08-06 23:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975586, 560612, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very very creative! well done.</td>', 'Very very creative! well done.', '2007-08-06 23:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975587, 555372, 889, '<td valign="top">YAY an Insect Action Shot!</td>', 'YAY an Insect Action Shot!', '2007-08-06 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975592, 548126, 18197, '<td valign="top">The rearview mirror shot is so cliched I''d normally give it a 3 tops. But this surprised me, how well done it is. I like it! Well done.</td>', 'The rearview mirror shot is so cliched I''d normally give it a 3 tops. But this surprised me, how well done it is. I like it! Well done.', '2007-08-06 23:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975595, 557995, 889, '<td valign="top">I cant wait to see what settings were used to get the sunlight though mist effect, I never seem to be able to catch it. The usual problem of taking a picture of airborne water.</td>', 'I cant wait to see what settings were used to get the sunlight though mist effect, I never seem to be able to catch it. The usual problem of taking a picture of airborne water.', '2007-08-06 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975601, 555780, 889, '<td valign="top">wow, do you bring pennies so you can make wishes in the ponds you overfly?</td>', 'wow, do you bring pennies so you can make wishes in the ponds you overfly?', '2007-08-06 23:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975605, 564503, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply elegant! Well done. It is so understated that it surpasses 90% of the photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Simply elegant! Well done. It is so understated that it surpasses 90% of the photos in this challenge.', '2007-08-06 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3975610, 559887, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done, if a bit over saturated.</td>', 'Well done, if a bit over saturated.', '2007-08-06 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
