(3976139, 561495, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Very sharp.  The colors of the model match well, but not so sure about the heels and dress as well as the not wind-blown but with a few strands somehow flying out hair.  Still an 8 for a very dramatic picture.  I wonder why the title isn''t in bold.</td>', 'Great picture.  Very sharp.  The colors of the model match well, but not so sure about the heels and dress as well as the not wind-blown but with a few strands somehow flying out hair.  Still an 8 for a very dramatic picture.  I wonder why the title isn''t in bold.', '2007-08-07 01:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
