(3977841, 562557, 889, '<td valign="top">Using the bronze statue is an excellent idea. Not only does it provide some contrast between old and new, but it provides a sense of scale and perspective on the future. Since cloning minor imperfections was allowed, I maybe would have taken out the street signs in the lower right corner. Only because it is a bright orange dot which keeps attracting my eye to that area.</td>', 'Using the bronze statue is an excellent idea. Not only does it provide some contrast between old and new, but it provides a sense of scale and perspective on the future. Since cloning minor imperfections was allowed, I maybe would have taken out the street signs in the lower right corner. Only because it is a bright orange dot which keeps attracting my eye to that area.', '2007-08-07 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
