(3977891, 564301, 889, '<td valign="top">Up close and personal. I may have tried to get a little wider shot on the head.  Color, texture, and focus are all good, though a shallower DOF may have been nice.</td>', 'Up close and personal. I may have tried to get a little wider shot on the head.  Color, texture, and focus are all good, though a shallower DOF may have been nice.', '2007-08-07 18:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3977897, 563012, 889, '<td valign="top">Cropping this closer on the right would have been good. It leaves more space for the boat to motor into. I would have thought about cloning out the dark buoy just below the horizon.</td>', 'Cropping this closer on the right would have been good. It leaves more space for the boat to motor into. I would have thought about cloning out the dark buoy just below the horizon.', '2007-08-07 18:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
