(3978518, 563100, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, lighting, and focus on this!  Congrats on getting close enough for this.  We have some large bullfrogs at our pond but I''ve yet to sneak up successfully with a camera in hand.  You''ve inspired me to try again!  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice color, lighting, and focus on this!  Congrats on getting close enough for this.  We have some large bullfrogs at our pond but I''ve yet to sneak up successfully with a camera in hand.  You''ve inspired me to try again!  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-08-07 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
