(3978532, 564509, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scene and a very nice photo overall.  At first I was thinking the foreground water and surrounding terrain was a little underexposed, but the sky is fine.  Tough place for a split ND.  Some haloing around the mountain top and trees in the sky area.  Not major, but noticeable.  Sorry if I''m taking anything away on this...just making some observations.  It really is a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a lovely scene and a very nice photo overall.  At first I was thinking the foreground water and surrounding terrain was a little underexposed, but the sky is fine.  Tough place for a split ND.  Some haloing around the mountain top and trees in the sky area.  Not major, but noticeable.  Sorry if I''m taking anything away on this...just making some observations.  It really is a nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-08-07 22:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
