(3978867, 564108, 50695, '<td valign="top">Quirky but conventional but mocking convention but thrilling in convention (as it bubbles up around you, around us). I feel as though I am watching Natalie Wood portraying her own death in a Fellini movie. 10</td>', 'Quirky but conventional but mocking convention but thrilling in convention (as it bubbles up around you, around us). I feel as though I am watching Natalie Wood portraying her own death in a Fellini movie. 10', '2007-08-08 00:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
