(3978871, 559813, 10263, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Diversity indeed. Interesting that they each have one hand by their mouths and are holding something in the other hand. Even what they are holding shows the diversity.. a paper bag, a newspaper and a brief case. You couldn''t have set up the situation and done any better. I like :)</td>', 'Great shot. Diversity indeed. Interesting that they each have one hand by their mouths and are holding something in the other hand. Even what they are holding shows the diversity.. a paper bag, a newspaper and a brief case. You couldn''t have set up the situation and done any better. I like :)', '2007-08-08 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3978872, 563798, 76676, '<td valign="top">Love this!</td>', 'Love this!', '2007-08-08 00:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3978873, 564156, 50695, '<td valign="top">This picture awes me. I feel like I am crashing into it. If you told me I was going to give a ribbon to an airplane shot, I wouldn''t have believed you. But this is just so beautiful and scary at the same time.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This picture awes me. I feel like I am crashing into it. If you told me I was going to give a ribbon to an airplane shot, I wouldn''t have believed you. But this is just so beautiful and scary at the same time. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2007-08-08 00:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3978875, 562227, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ecstasy in the form of a photograph. You go underneath expectation, underneath representation, underneath the real, and you find something more.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Ecstasy in the form of a photograph. You go underneath expectation, underneath representation, underneath the real, and you find something more. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon: ', '2007-08-08 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3978877, 555598, 50695, '<td valign="top">Excellent recreation of the silent film look. And how did you make Carrie Fisher young again? 10</td>', 'Excellent recreation of the silent film look. And how did you make Carrie Fisher young again? 10', '2007-08-08 00:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
