(3978881, 553825, 50695, '<td valign="top">there''s a certain DPC kitschiness to this, but something more than that, as revealed by your title. The swan is turning into a constellation. It''s like watching a myth come to life.</td>', 'there''s a certain DPC kitschiness to this, but something more than that, as revealed by your title. The swan is turning into a constellation. It''s like watching a myth come to life.', '2007-08-08 00:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
