(3979478, 557929, 75386, '<td valign="top">Good expressive shot.  I like the contrast a lot so it was a good choice for BW.<br/> <br/>We got the same score practically on this challenge :)</td>', 'Good expressive shot.  I like the contrast a lot so it was a good choice for BW. We got the same score practically on this challenge :)', '2007-08-08 02:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3979483, 557690, 39349, '<td valign="top">WOW I really thought this would be on the front page, I voted this a 10 during voting. This is amazing on so many levels, but the biggest one to me is how inspiring this shot is.<br/> <br/>eta:<br/> <br/>Ditto on the slide show my jaw is still on the desk! Oh and add me to the list of <i>"I''ll wear what ever you want"</i> if you''ll shoot it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-08 01:29:26.</i></td>', 'WOW I really thought this would be on the front page, I voted this a 10 during voting. This is amazing on so many levels, but the biggest one to me is how inspiring this shot is. eta: Ditto on the slide show my jaw is still on the desk! Oh and add me to the list of "I''ll wear what ever you want" if you''ll shoot it!', '2007-08-08 02:22:13.000000', '2007-08-08 02:29:26.000000', 0),
(3979484, 561740, 889, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna have to play around with this some. Though I don''t have anywhere close to the amount of zoom I would need to pull it off as well.  I still wonder why you didn''t pre-submit the validation rather than waiting for it to happen when you posted the picture. I''m betting that would have helped the score a good bit. I''ve noticed that people vote down a suspected fake even if they submit it for validation.</td>', 'I''m gonna have to play around with this some. Though I don''t have anywhere close to the amount of zoom I would need to pull it off as well.  I still wonder why you didn''t pre-submit the validation rather than waiting for it to happen when you posted the picture. I''m betting that would have helped the score a good bit. I''ve noticed that people vote down a suspected fake even if they submit it for validation.', '2007-08-08 02:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
