(3979499, 564590, 48471, '<td valign="top">Such a usual mundane scene, bordering to boredom, with such unusual colours, repelling and insulting to Nature (She wouldn''t make something so ugly!)...I fail to understand what''s going on and what''s the point, as if there should be one...A transit to where? A good exercise, but a real artist would never show this to everyone, so if I could, now that I know, I''d vote this a 1.</td>', 'Such a usual mundane scene, bordering to boredom, with such unusual colours, repelling and insulting to Nature (She wouldn''t make something so ugly!)...I fail to understand what''s going on and what''s the point, as if there should be one...A transit to where? A good exercise, but a real artist would never show this to everyone, so if I could, now that I know, I''d vote this a 1.', '2007-08-08 02:30:03.000000', NULL, 0),
