(3980270, 564435, 66384, '<td valign="top">Where are those trolls when you need them? ;D  I like this a lot. It''s very restful, and I could look at it for a long time. I love the green shades and patterns of the background, and the web gives it just enough detail to keep it from being dull.</td>', 'Where are those trolls when you need them? ;D  I like this a lot. It''s very restful, and I could look at it for a long time. I love the green shades and patterns of the background, and the web gives it just enough detail to keep it from being dull.', '2007-08-08 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980278, 563646, 70514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture and eye contact.</td>', 'Beautiful capture and eye contact.', '2007-08-08 10:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980281, 556758, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The light here is great.  Love the scene.</td>', 'Nice!  The light here is great.  Love the scene.', '2007-08-08 10:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980293, 564375, 70514, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh!  I LOVE this, Barbara!  The processing is so wonderful, and the fact that this is in an otherwise abandoned bldg... very cool.  And so odd!</td>', 'Oh my gosh!  I LOVE this, Barbara!  The processing is so wonderful, and the fact that this is in an otherwise abandoned bldg... very cool.  And so odd!', '2007-08-08 10:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980297, 564375, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Looks like some third world country. I like the conversion and tones. I think I would like it better without the sign. The rest of the shot looks almost like a painting. Great texture.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Looks like some third world country. I like the conversion and tones. I think I would like it better without the sign. The rest of the shot looks almost like a painting. Great texture.', '2007-08-08 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980304, 563402, 42100, '<td valign="top">You know I pretty much expected your triumph entry to score sub-six, we all know this place to well!  But the score on this is a crime of epic proportions!</td>', 'You know I pretty much expected your triumph entry to score sub-six, we all know this place to well!  But the score on this is a crime of epic proportions!', '2007-08-08 10:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980310, 564481, 74605, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot.  The white swan is beautiful against the dark colors of the water.  The reflection is nice as well.  Well done.</td>', 'Incredible shot.  The white swan is beautiful against the dark colors of the water.  The reflection is nice as well.  Well done.', '2007-08-08 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980313, 563402, 67152, '<td valign="top">Wow - I am shocked - I really thought this would be well in the mid to upper 6s.  Great composition, fantastic perspective, awesome timing, great lighting and lines.  5.6??????!!!</td>', 'Wow - I am shocked - I really thought this would be well in the mid to upper 6s.  Great composition, fantastic perspective, awesome timing, great lighting and lines.  5.6??????!!!', '2007-08-08 10:25:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980323, 560636, 58360, '<td valign="top">Yes a certain amount of luck is necessary for a good shot.  But you deserve all the credit for seizing the opportunity and making it work!  Good shot.  Congrats</td>', 'Yes a certain amount of luck is necessary for a good shot.  But you deserve all the credit for seizing the opportunity and making it work!  Good shot.  Congrats', '2007-08-08 10:27:25.000000', NULL, 0),
