(3980376, 561740, 40718, '<td valign="top">Awesome double exposure!  I''m really impressed.  Thanks for the great description too Jeffrey.  Should have placed higher for the effort.</td>', 'Awesome double exposure!  I''m really impressed.  Thanks for the great description too Jeffrey.  Should have placed higher for the effort.', '2007-08-08 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980386, 563093, 74605, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Your centered composition accents the flower nicely.  Beautiful sky as well.</td>', 'Great image.  Your centered composition accents the flower nicely.  Beautiful sky as well.', '2007-08-08 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980424, 561740, 67697, '<td valign="top">Thanks for a really detailed explanation of what you did.  The shot makes it look like the moon is right there, sharing the same air space.  Very cool photo.</td>', 'Thanks for a really detailed explanation of what you did.  The shot makes it look like the moon is right there, sharing the same air space.  Very cool photo.', '2007-08-08 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980438, 563434, 53278, '<td valign="top">i knew it! while browsing through the entries i figured this one is yours!<br/> <br/>great shot, def. deserve a higher score and a higher placement! i could use the competition:P</td>', 'i knew it! while browsing through the entries i figured this one is yours! great shot, def. deserve a higher score and a higher placement! i could use the competition:P', '2007-08-08 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980447, 561655, 56254, '<td valign="top">I think that this shot suffered onaccounta 2 things ... one, it''s not the tack sharp image that DPC''ers crave ... and two, it''s quite dark ... not very much detail in his jacket or the background (which may have been the look you were going for) ... but playing with curves/levels may have helped you bring out some more details ... I think that the subject is very interesting and the composition is strong ...</td>', 'I think that this shot suffered onaccounta 2 things ... one, it''s not the tack sharp image that DPC''ers crave ... and two, it''s quite dark ... not very much detail in his jacket or the background (which may have been the look you were going for) ... but playing with curves/levels may have helped you bring out some more details ... I think that the subject is very interesting and the composition is strong ...', '2007-08-08 10:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980460, 561655, 69493, '<td valign="top">I think it is a good overall shot.  It is composed well and it has good emotions to it.  My problem with this shot is that it is soft.  I think if his face was a little sharper it would help.  He has great "life lines" on his face and I think sharpening would bring them out.  I also would have brightened it out a little bit.  I know you where going for the darker look(at least I think you where)  but the harsh shadows take away from the details of his face.  I want to see more of him.  It seems like the light is on the hat and not on his face.  Even though the hat is nice I would rather see more of his face.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'I think it is a good overall shot.  It is composed well and it has good emotions to it.  My problem with this shot is that it is soft.  I think if his face was a little sharper it would help.  He has great "life lines" on his face and I think sharpening would bring them out.  I also would have brightened it out a little bit.  I know you where going for the darker look(at least I think you where)  but the harsh shadows take away from the details of his face.  I want to see more of him.  It seems like the light is on the hat and not on his face.  Even though the hat is nice I would rather see more of his face.   ', '2007-08-08 10:50:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980481, 564313, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like the way you processed this.  In another challenge I think this would have scored much higher -- it just had to compete with too many jaw-dropping gallery pieces in this one.   It''s very nice tho!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the way you processed this.  In another challenge I think this would have scored much higher -- it just had to compete with too many jaw-dropping gallery pieces in this one.   It''s very nice tho! ', '2007-08-08 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
