(3980560, 557929, 66384, '<td valign="top">The processing seems rather harsh to me, making the image look more like an illustration than a portrait. I like the composition, light, and subject. Maybe you could sell this to Coke Cola. It would make a great ad (maybe with the can in red).</td>', 'The processing seems rather harsh to me, making the image look more like an illustration than a portrait. I like the composition, light, and subject. Maybe you could sell this to Coke Cola. It would make a great ad (maybe with the can in red).', '2007-08-08 11:14:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980571, 563100, 30049, '<td valign="top">Funny, I didn''t even notice that piece of foreground grass and I gave this a 10.  Shows how much I know!  :D<br/> <br/>Actually, now that I think about it some more, that foreground grass adds a leading element for the viewer and is possibly an enhancing diagonal line.  Hmmm.<br/> <br/>Perhaps this image needs a bit of of disecting yet.  Oops!  Sorry frog, nothing personal.  (as my wife would say, I''m just cracking myself up).  He-he.<br/> <br/>Anyway, nice finish Trevor.  I see it''s made it into your top 4.  Congrats!</td>', 'Funny, I didn''t even notice that piece of foreground grass and I gave this a 10.  Shows how much I know!  :D Actually, now that I think about it some more, that foreground grass adds a leading element for the viewer and is possibly an enhancing diagonal line.  Hmmm. Perhaps this image needs a bit of of disecting yet.  Oops!  Sorry frog, nothing personal.  (as my wife would say, I''m just cracking myself up).  He-he. Anyway, nice finish Trevor.  I see it''s made it into your top 4.  Congrats!', '2007-08-08 11:16:01.000000', NULL, 0),
