(3980657, 560636, 66597, '<td valign="top">Being originally from Montana, I was certain this was taken in Glacier National Park or similar. I would never have expected this to be a zoo photo. Many congrats on highly deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Being originally from Montana, I was certain this was taken in Glacier National Park or similar. I would never have expected this to be a zoo photo. Many congrats on highly deserved ribbon!', '2007-08-08 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3980659, 561782, 30049, '<td valign="top">Score 1 for the border, 6 against.  :P<br/> <br/>Amazing how minute details get the attention sometimes.  I hope you''ve found a nice frame for this.  :)<br/> <br/>Still standing by my ''10''.  Fair score overall, 110th?  Hmmm.  In the end, certainly a shot to be proud of.  Well done!</td>', 'Score 1 for the border, 6 against.  :P Amazing how minute details get the attention sometimes.  I hope you''ve found a nice frame for this.  :) Still standing by my ''10''.  Fair score overall, 110th?  Hmmm.  In the end, certainly a shot to be proud of.  Well done!', '2007-08-08 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
