(3980721, 562067, 40126, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> David!!!  Wow!!!   YOU are THE MAN!!!   Your work just BLOWS me away!   I am looking so forward to learning from you once the team thing gets started!!<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanks soo much Sandy for the extra moral boost! i''m sure it will be the other way around... i will learn a gazillion of things from! my privilege to be in the team with you, mak and the rest!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: David!!!  Wow!!!   YOU are THE MAN!!!   Your work just BLOWS me away!   I am looking so forward to learning from you once the team thing gets started!! CONGRATULATIONS!   thanks soo much Sandy for the extra moral boost! i''m sure it will be the other way around... i will learn a gazillion of things from! my privilege to be in the team with you, mak and the rest!!!', '2007-08-08 11:58:29.000000', NULL, 0),
