(3981024, 564590, 32997, '<td valign="top">you know it is hard to follow such a strong reaction...and one that is not unfair, yet I don''t feel the same way...I am drawn to this pointless landscape with Burt Reynolds in the foreground...I don''t know why, as really you have made this completely bland by lowering the contrast levels to the point where I want to look away...mundane yes, but why does he have his hand sitting like that and why is he standing there?<br/>and man I want to letterbox this sucker, but hey I will leave my personal obsessions on my computer...<br/>though I think it is because the sky is too strong here, and too separate from this confrontation...<br/>I am saying nothing right, wandering around but definitely not ignoring, and you just stand back and smile, aware that you have stopped me in your tracks...<br/>I plan to call this shot Transit, I am simply ignoring you now...</td>', 'you know it is hard to follow such a strong reaction...and one that is not unfair, yet I don''t feel the same way...I am drawn to this pointless landscape with Burt Reynolds in the foreground...I don''t know why, as really you have made this completely bland by lowering the contrast levels to the point where I want to look away...mundane yes, but why does he have his hand sitting like that and why is he standing there?and man I want to letterbox this sucker, but hey I will leave my personal obsessions on my computer...though I think it is because the sky is too strong here, and too separate from this confrontation...I am saying nothing right, wandering around but definitely not ignoring, and you just stand back and smile, aware that you have stopped me in your tracks...I plan to call this shot Transit, I am simply ignoring you now...', '2007-08-08 13:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
