(3981811, 561470, 77365, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback yes this is from a trolley in Memphis, Tenn. and i wanted to crop that edge however just coming out of some old school teaching  a refrained from cropping. The sky was not popped because i again refrained from heavy photoshop curves. I was looking at the the clouds mimicing the sculpture and the brigde lining up with sculpture blah blah blah yeah it is easy to fallin love with your own work.</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback yes this is from a trolley in Memphis, Tenn. and i wanted to crop that edge however just coming out of some old school teaching  a refrained from cropping. The sky was not popped because i again refrained from heavy photoshop curves. I was looking at the the clouds mimicing the sculpture and the brigde lining up with sculpture blah blah blah yeah it is easy to fallin love with your own work.', '2007-08-08 18:33:31.000000', NULL, 0),
