(3988734, 558286, 48228, '<td valign="top">I am totally amazed that <b>no one</b> commented on this image, in the challenge. <br/>It is totally a great macro, with amazing clarity and detail. <br/> <br/>I <b>LOVE</b> it, and sorry I didnot comment on any of the images in this free study, due to getting a head cold the day after it started. <br/>I did plan to do a 100% vote and comment, but only was able to complete the voting. I gave this one a very good score.<br/> <br/>You are so young, and at 14 years of age, I thik I will one day see many ribbons in your portfolio.</td>', 'I am totally amazed that no one commented on this image, in the challenge. It is totally a great macro, with amazing clarity and detail.  I LOVE it, and sorry I didnot comment on any of the images in this free study, due to getting a head cold the day after it started. I did plan to do a 100% vote and comment, but only was able to complete the voting. I gave this one a very good score. You are so young, and at 14 years of age, I thik I will one day see many ribbons in your portfolio.', '2007-08-11 11:39:20.000000', NULL, 0),
