(3989076, 563969, 67237, '<td valign="top">Could you please post the original, to see the before and after of this wondeful pp work?</td>', 'Could you please post the original, to see the before and after of this wondeful pp work?', '2007-08-11 16:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3989121, 547477, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is a remarkable image for its lighting and sense of otherworldliness.  I was going to say the tilt is a bit too extreme for my taste, but as I sit here I can''t imagine it having the same striking impact with a lesser tilt - maybe that''s what makes the ''wow'' effect for this shot - how it goes so flagrantly against our expectations of a more leveled composition.</td>', 'This is a remarkable image for its lighting and sense of otherworldliness.  I was going to say the tilt is a bit too extreme for my taste, but as I sit here I can''t imagine it having the same striking impact with a lesser tilt - maybe that''s what makes the ''wow'' effect for this shot - how it goes so flagrantly against our expectations of a more leveled composition.', '2007-08-11 17:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3989129, 562603, 61651, '<td valign="top">A truly standout shot - an almost mathematical variety; brilliant crop/framing and use of your subjects to form their own leading line.</td>', 'A truly standout shot - an almost mathematical variety; brilliant crop/framing and use of your subjects to form their own leading line.', '2007-08-11 17:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3989131, 563216, 61651, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking capture - one of my instant tens.  And seriously, I''m going to have to convince you to tell me how you do b&amp;w conversions - do you have a price? :)</td>', 'Breathtaking capture - one of my instant tens.  And seriously, I''m going to have to convince you to tell me how you do b&w conversions - do you have a price? :)', '2007-08-11 17:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3989133, 560625, 61651, '<td valign="top">The beauty of this shot - to me, I cannot put it into words.  What you''ve accomplished here is admirable.  And don''t ever think of removing that airplane. :)</td>', 'The beauty of this shot - to me, I cannot put it into words.  What you''ve accomplished here is admirable.  And don''t ever think of removing that airplane. :)', '2007-08-11 17:28:49.000000', NULL, 0),
