(3990449, 564435, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I raved during the challenge, but I will again.  The misty green is so appealing and even the thumb is pretty, without being able to see the delicate web (or maybe you can and me not wearing my glasses is a problem - LOL) Such a fan of this.  Shocked it was so low on the totem pole.</td>', 'I think I raved during the challenge, but I will again.  The misty green is so appealing and even the thumb is pretty, without being able to see the delicate web (or maybe you can and me not wearing my glasses is a problem - LOL) Such a fan of this.  Shocked it was so low on the totem pole.', '2007-08-12 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
