(3994841, 555280, 67145, '<td valign="top">another awesome shot sue ... <br/>when i opened this amazingly excellent photograph and saw the score of 5.9612 my jaw dropped ... fortunately i was able to catch it before it hit the ground ... i''m thinking more and more that some of the voters should be banned ... like i cant imagine anyone giving this 5 or under .. you''ve gotta account for personal taste i spose and some ppl just mightnt like cows but you''d think they''d go .. "hey, i dont like cows but this is really an excellent photograph .. i''ll give it a 6 because i dont like cows, but if i did like cows i''d be giving it at least an 8" .!! ... obviously some ppl dont give their brains the time of day or  or get past their personality problems !!<br/>i had a whinge to greg after looking thru a couple of challenges and seeing some woeful scores on the most excellent images .. he said i should write to the sc and make a complaint of sorts .. but i said .. ''wot can they do ???'' .. <br/>you want ppl to vote their opinions ... you dont want idiots to vote nonsensical scores ... but you cant police it .. i think mostly the excellent photographs usually do very well, but there are so many incredible images that score much less than they are worth .. your cows are a perfect example .. a stunning and beautiful photograph ...  wot more can i say .. !!!!!!!!!!!! ... lol lol ... <br/></td>', 'another awesome shot sue ... when i opened this amazingly excellent photograph and saw the score of 5.9612 my jaw dropped ... fortunately i was able to catch it before it hit the ground ... i''m thinking more and more that some of the voters should be banned ... like i cant imagine anyone giving this 5 or under .. you''ve gotta account for personal taste i spose and some ppl just mightnt like cows but you''d think they''d go .. "hey, i dont like cows but this is really an excellent photograph .. i''ll give it a 6 because i dont like cows, but if i did like cows i''d be giving it at least an 8" .!! ... obviously some ppl dont give their brains the time of day or  or get past their personality problems !!i had a whinge to greg after looking thru a couple of challenges and seeing some woeful scores on the most excellent images .. he said i should write to the sc and make a complaint of sorts .. but i said .. ''wot can they do ???'' .. you want ppl to vote their opinions ... you dont want idiots to vote nonsensical scores ... but you cant police it .. i think mostly the excellent photographs usually do very well, but there are so many incredible images that score much less than they are worth .. your cows are a perfect example .. a stunning and beautiful photograph ...  wot more can i say .. !!!!!!!!!!!! ... lol lol ... ', '2007-08-13 18:47:13.000000', NULL, 0),
