(3995064, 557445, 50695, '<td valign="top">Well, you achieved the ad look, and the vacant look. I just don''t understand why ads need to have that look. It doesn''t make me want to buy anything. In case you''re interested, I gave this photo a 5 because it successfully achieved what it was trying to achieve.</td>', 'Well, you achieved the ad look, and the vacant look. I just don''t understand why ads need to have that look. It doesn''t make me want to buy anything. In case you''re interested, I gave this photo a 5 because it successfully achieved what it was trying to achieve.', '2007-08-13 20:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3995181, 557445, 71664, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this shot.  The light is nice on both their faces.  The 1st thing that jumped out at me was the purple light under his chin and then a bit later, I noticed the purple light on his shirt.  I find it really distracting when I am trying to look at the rest of the photo and my eyes continue to jump back at to the purple.  The compostion is nice and you did a good job posing the models together.  As well, both of his hands are just cut off and it would have been nice if they were fully in the frame.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Overall, I like this shot.  The light is nice on both their faces.  The 1st thing that jumped out at me was the purple light under his chin and then a bit later, I noticed the purple light on his shirt.  I find it really distracting when I am trying to look at the rest of the photo and my eyes continue to jump back at to the purple.  The compostion is nice and you did a good job posing the models together.  As well, both of his hands are just cut off and it would have been nice if they were fully in the frame.  Nice photo.', '2007-08-13 21:16:23.000000', NULL, 0),
