(4003569, 558957, 56744, '<td valign="top">Great composition, Keith. Like one of these classical paintings. The harmony between all the elements is magical. Even the soft focus is working very well for the mood around. I only found the rope coming from right against the flow of the picture. But that doesnt take any merit to this fine work.</td>', 'Great composition, Keith. Like one of these classical paintings. The harmony between all the elements is magical. Even the soft focus is working very well for the mood around. I only found the rope coming from right against the flow of the picture. But that doesnt take any merit to this fine work.', '2007-08-16 08:14:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4006722, 563397, 66597, '<td valign="top">The colors, exposure and lines are all lovely here. Unfortunately, you were punished by the voters because the photo is not quite in focus. With a tripod, this could very easily have been in the mid-6 range. You have a great eye - now all you need to do is steady that camera :-)</td>', 'The colors, exposure and lines are all lovely here. Unfortunately, you were punished by the voters because the photo is not quite in focus. With a tripod, this could very easily have been in the mid-6 range. You have a great eye - now all you need to do is steady that camera :-)', '2007-08-17 13:46:49.000000', NULL, 0),
