(4017189, 557445, 61654, '<td valign="top">He looks stiff and uncomfortable, but she looks perfect.  I definately got that you were going for an "ad" type look.  I can''t stop staring at his front arm. It just looks too forced. I think the lighting is cool (except for the purple glowy thing under his chin).  Overall I think this is a good shot though. Just being picky! :)</td>', 'He looks stiff and uncomfortable, but she looks perfect.  I definately got that you were going for an "ad" type look.  I can''t stop staring at his front arm. It just looks too forced. I think the lighting is cool (except for the purple glowy thing under his chin).  Overall I think this is a good shot though. Just being picky! :)', '2007-08-21 12:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
