(4026284, 554354, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent sky, and you captured it well, then adjusted it to be just beautiful. Sky shots are not appreciated here at DPC with the same fervor as photos that take technical expertise and a lot of time to set up and shoot. I don''t know why though, I love good ones like this.  Maybe it is because sky conditions just happen, and are not repeatable, so you are just capturing the moment instead of planning, placing, adjusting lighting and shooting.  In any case, this is at least a mid 7 or 8 in my rating scale.</td>', 'This is an excellent sky, and you captured it well, then adjusted it to be just beautiful. Sky shots are not appreciated here at DPC with the same fervor as photos that take technical expertise and a lot of time to set up and shoot. I don''t know why though, I love good ones like this.  Maybe it is because sky conditions just happen, and are not repeatable, so you are just capturing the moment instead of planning, placing, adjusting lighting and shooting.  In any case, this is at least a mid 7 or 8 in my rating scale.', '2007-08-24 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
