(4028353, 564590, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very otherworldly processing, certainly takes the mundane to another level.  Those dayglo taillights on the background car draws the eye (not suggesting this is either a good or a bad thing, just noting it).  I found this shot unsettling, which may count as success given your title - I think what makes it unsettling is the color palette - you''ve got this dark foreboding sky and overall greyness, evoking emotions contrariwise to the scattered eruptions of pastel-ly colors.</td>', 'Very otherworldly processing, certainly takes the mundane to another level.  Those dayglo taillights on the background car draws the eye (not suggesting this is either a good or a bad thing, just noting it).  I found this shot unsettling, which may count as success given your title - I think what makes it unsettling is the color palette - you''ve got this dark foreboding sky and overall greyness, evoking emotions contrariwise to the scattered eruptions of pastel-ly colors.', '2007-08-25 15:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
