(4120302, 563169, 30049, '<td valign="top">Most people would be excited just to have experienced seeing a wolf pup in the wild, yet you not only were able to get a great photo of the event to treasure forever, you also interacted with this beautiful animal!  Wow!  That''s very cool.<br/> <br/>I really like the color and the glow you achieved in processing this shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Most people would be excited just to have experienced seeing a wolf pup in the wild, yet you not only were able to get a great photo of the event to treasure forever, you also interacted with this beautiful animal!  Wow!  That''s very cool. I really like the color and the glow you achieved in processing this shot.  Nicely done.', '2007-09-27 14:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4125723, 562794, 55838, '<td valign="top">This shot is awesome!  Of course it''s perfect in b&amp;w and I love the contrast but most of all I love that it tells a story - gives me the slightest little glimpse into the lives of folks in an unfamiliar situation being able to enjoy a little smidgeon of the familiar.  I even like that the light coming in the windows obliterates any details of the outside world - hopefully this place serves to do that for these soldiers - even if just for a minute.  Very nice.  Adding to favorites.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-30 09:21:14.</i></td>', 'This shot is awesome!  Of course it''s perfect in b&w and I love the contrast but most of all I love that it tells a story - gives me the slightest little glimpse into the lives of folks in an unfamiliar situation being able to enjoy a little smidgeon of the familiar.  I even like that the light coming in the windows obliterates any details of the outside world - hopefully this place serves to do that for these soldiers - even if just for a minute.  Very nice.  Adding to favorites.', '2007-09-30 10:17:48.000000', '2007-09-30 10:21:14.000000', 0),
(4133123, 562746, 74559, '<td valign="top">Looking through your portfolio and came across this incredibly striking image. Wow! I love the tones, the lighting, the crop and angle, all the expressive boys... this is just fantastic (though I too must admit I''d rather not see the feet cropped out). Score doesn''t do it justice...I bet it would''ve cleaned up in the current ''Group Portrait'' challenge :-)</td>', 'Looking through your portfolio and came across this incredibly striking image. Wow! I love the tones, the lighting, the crop and angle, all the expressive boys... this is just fantastic (though I too must admit I''d rather not see the feet cropped out). Score doesn''t do it justice...I bet it would''ve cleaned up in the current ''Group Portrait'' challenge :-)', '2007-10-02 12:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4135846, 563493, 28710, '<td valign="top">Wow. the strong complete desaturation in the sky and the road are excellent complements. The grain gives excellent effect as well, heightening the contrast between the surrealistic B&amp;W elements and the idyllic colored elements which have a gentle touch of editing.<br/> <br/>Very strong sense of depth. Good stuff!</td>', 'Wow. the strong complete desaturation in the sky and the road are excellent complements. The grain gives excellent effect as well, heightening the contrast between the surrealistic B&W elements and the idyllic colored elements which have a gentle touch of editing. Very strong sense of depth. Good stuff!', '2007-10-03 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
