(4226257, 563934, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a great looking place - I would love to hang out there.  I hope you had a great enough time for the both of us!  Cool shot.  Too bad one of those "symetry" challenges didn''t pop up at the right time for this shot! Very pretty colors.</td>', 'What a great looking place - I would love to hang out there.  I hope you had a great enough time for the both of us!  Cool shot.  Too bad one of those "symetry" challenges didn''t pop up at the right time for this shot! Very pretty colors.', '2007-11-06 20:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4247094, 559387, 80296, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Does it always rain there?  :)  This is a popular spot for DPC challenge entries with the wonderful light reflections.  I like the way you used the lines of the bricks where they merge.  Good luck! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It''s always raining photographers at the Pike Place Market.<br/>Seattle gets 32" per year. Summers are dry.  Frequently it rains and is sunny in the same day hence "emerald city" designation with frequent rainbows.  <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Does it always rain there?  :)  This is a popular spot for DPC challenge entries with the wonderful light reflections.  I like the way you used the lines of the bricks where they merge.  Good luck!  It''s always raining photographers at the Pike Place Market.Seattle gets 32" per year. Summers are dry.  Frequently it rains and is sunny in the same day hence "emerald city" designation with frequent rainbows.  ', '2007-11-14 13:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
