(4383645, 563691, 73452, '<td valign="top">Great photo Kelly.  I really like it.  I hate entering Free Study''s unless I have a photo from Iceland or something.  They''re just so hard to pull a decent score out of.  But the neon lights are awesome, and the depth is spot on.</td>', 'Great photo Kelly.  I really like it.  I hate entering Free Study''s unless I have a photo from Iceland or something.  They''re just so hard to pull a decent score out of.  But the neon lights are awesome, and the depth is spot on.', '2008-01-11 01:03:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4384598, 561383, 47906, '<td valign="top">I think alot of the issue with this photo came with the focusing, I have looked at it on 2 monitiors(one cal''d, one not) and the focus seems soft one both. It sadly seems a bit worse on the uncal''d one. I am going to give a bit of both to you and hope it helps you.<br/> <br/>On the cal''d monitor, the colors are good, the softness dulls the texture of the mountain not giving a sharp feel to it. On the uncal''d monitor, the trees look blurred together slightly and again the mountain is not sharp. <br/> <br/>I like the idea of it but I was one of your 5''s in the challenge due to the overall photo being less sharp.<br/> <br/>HTH,</td>', 'I think alot of the issue with this photo came with the focusing, I have looked at it on 2 monitiors(one cal''d, one not) and the focus seems soft one both. It sadly seems a bit worse on the uncal''d one. I am going to give a bit of both to you and hope it helps you. On the cal''d monitor, the colors are good, the softness dulls the texture of the mountain not giving a sharp feel to it. On the uncal''d monitor, the trees look blurred together slightly and again the mountain is not sharp.  I like the idea of it but I was one of your 5''s in the challenge due to the overall photo being less sharp. HTH,', '2008-01-11 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4387634, 561371, 54885, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2008-01-12 20:14:58.000000', NULL, 0),
